(2712218, 375668, 61971, '<td valign="top">A little on the small side. I am a fan of black and white but this really does not do anything for me. I am not really drawn to a particular subject.</td>', 'A little on the small side. I am a fan of black and white but this really does not do anything for me. I am not really drawn to a particular subject.', '2006-08-09 20:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712219, 376110, 61971, '<td valign="top">Nice car. A little on the small side. Too blurry imo.</td>', 'Nice car. A little on the small side. Too blurry imo.', '2006-08-09 20:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712221, 377616, 61971, '<td valign="top">imo the skateboarder is too dark. The rocks and the tree really take my eyes off of him.</td>', 'imo the skateboarder is too dark. The rocks and the tree really take my eyes off of him.', '2006-08-09 20:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712222, 377365, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better if the shutter speed was longer to give fuller light trails.  Some people might like the fact that they are broken up, but I find them distracting.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better if the shutter speed was longer to give fuller light trails.  Some people might like the fact that they are broken up, but I find them distracting.', '2006-08-09 20:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712223, 375550, 61971, '<td valign="top">Cute name. I like the tone and composition.</td>', 'Cute name. I like the tone and composition.', '2006-08-09 20:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712226, 376221, 61971, '<td valign="top">unique idea. imo the lighting is wrong though. I guess I dont like the red comming from the left side.</td>', 'unique idea. imo the lighting is wrong though. I guess I dont like the red comming from the left side.', '2006-08-09 20:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712227, 377321, 63267, '<td valign="top">I would like this a lot more if you cropped a bit off the right.  That way the pillar would be the edge of the frame instead of the distracting open space that you have.</td>', 'I would like this a lot more if you cropped a bit off the right.  That way the pillar would be the edge of the frame instead of the distracting open space that you have.', '2006-08-09 20:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712231, 377221, 63267, '<td valign="top">That just looks like fun.  I really like how the red chute stands out against the blues and greens.  Great shot.</td>', 'That just looks like fun.  I really like how the red chute stands out against the blues and greens.  Great shot.', '2006-08-09 20:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712232, 373910, 61971, '<td valign="top">imo its a little dull. also, the little sliver on the left side should be cropped out. otherwise good subject. :)</td>', 'imo its a little dull. also, the little sliver on the left side should be cropped out. otherwise good subject. :)', '2006-08-09 20:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712235, 377341, 61971, '<td valign="top">imo a little too blurry.</td>', 'imo a little too blurry.', '2006-08-09 20:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712237, 373995, 63267, '<td valign="top">Another BP gas station.  Aren''t they popular this week.  Good take on the theme, but I think it would have been executed better if you cropped the right of the picture off to focus on the man versus the cars in the street and the Colonel''s famous chicken.</td>', 'Another BP gas station.  Aren''t they popular this week.  Good take on the theme, but I think it would have been executed better if you cropped the right of the picture off to focus on the man versus the cars in the street and the Colonel''s famous chicken.', '2006-08-09 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712242, 373987, 19944, '<td valign="top">Well executed and a different take on the "transportation" theme.  I love the cars streaking by.<br/> <br/>Be sure to use the full 640 pixels allowed for your picture size.  You may lose some points for being small.  If you need some help, let me know, and I''ll tell you how.</td>', 'Well executed and a different take on the "transportation" theme.  I love the cars streaking by. Be sure to use the full 640 pixels allowed for your picture size.  You may lose some points for being small.  If you need some help, let me know, and I''ll tell you how.', '2006-08-09 20:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712250, 376951, 63267, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I really like this photo.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I really like this photo.', '2006-08-09 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712252, 375505, 61971, '<td valign="top">What a great picture. I love the subject.</td>', 'What a great picture. I love the subject.', '2006-08-09 20:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712255, 377219, 61971, '<td valign="top">I feel like the focus is more on the light house than the truck.</td>', 'I feel like the focus is more on the light house than the truck.', '2006-08-09 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712256, 377306, 61971, '<td valign="top">too cute. I really like the lighting.</td>', 'too cute. I really like the lighting.', '2006-08-09 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712257, 376551, 63267, '<td valign="top">You could also name this one expensive transportation!  Great shot of a Globemaster III about to touchdown.</td>', 'You could also name this one expensive transportation!  Great shot of a Globemaster III about to touchdown.', '2006-08-09 20:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712258, 376517, 61971, '<td valign="top">oh my. now that is unique. :)</td>', 'oh my. now that is unique. :)', '2006-08-09 20:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712259, 374979, 61971, '<td valign="top">thats cute. great shot and color.</td>', 'thats cute. great shot and color.', '2006-08-09 20:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712265, 376371, 61971, '<td valign="top">omg. great laugh out loud picture. I cant decide if I like the dof or not. It brings out his nose and mouth which really gives it extra character. If you have one with his whole head in focus I would love to see it in outtakes. :)</td>', 'omg. great laugh out loud picture. I cant decide if I like the dof or not. It brings out his nose and mouth which really gives it extra character. If you have one with his whole head in focus I would love to see it in outtakes. :)', '2006-08-09 20:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712266, 377231, 63267, '<td valign="top">You forgot one zoom in your title.   Nice photo though.</td>', 'You forgot one zoom in your title.   Nice photo though.', '2006-08-09 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712269, 377215, 61971, '<td valign="top">thats awesome. I wish the tram was not blurry though.</td>', 'thats awesome. I wish the tram was not blurry though.', '2006-08-09 20:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712271, 375383, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really like the color.</td>', 'I really like the color.', '2006-08-09 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712275, 377381, 61971, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great picture. I love the steam and the stark black and white. 10!</td>', 'Wow. Great picture. I love the steam and the stark black and white. 10!', '2006-08-09 20:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712284, 375506, 61818, '<td valign="top">Big ww2 buff here, so I like the subject matter.  Meets the challenge so that is good.  Overall the shot is a little dark and it looks like the focus is a bit soft on the bike.  At the same time, the darkness of the shot does give a sense of the dark days of war so it works.</td>', 'Big ww2 buff here, so I like the subject matter.  Meets the challenge so that is good.  Overall the shot is a little dark and it looks like the focus is a bit soft on the bike.  At the same time, the darkness of the shot does give a sense of the dark days of war so it works.', '2006-08-09 20:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712286, 377417, 61971, '<td valign="top">small and dark</td>', 'small and dark', '2006-08-09 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712293, 375995, 61818, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this picture is very poor.  The composition is very jumbled and there really isn''t any one thing that draws the eye to it.  While the majority of the shot is orangeish on a shadowed background, there is a distracting bar if bright light on the right side.  <br/> <br/>You have some really interesting textures and objects to work with here.  Cropping this shot so that you show just enough of the wagon to make it obvious it is a wagon (and I''m actually assuming that''s a wagon) but cutting out a lot of the other clutter would go a long way towards making this a better photo.</td>', 'The lighting in this picture is very poor.  The composition is very jumbled and there really isn''t any one thing that draws the eye to it.  While the majority of the shot is orangeish on a shadowed background, there is a distracting bar if bright light on the right side.   You have some really interesting textures and objects to work with here.  Cropping this shot so that you show just enough of the wagon to make it obvious it is a wagon (and I''m actually assuming that''s a wagon) but cutting out a lot of the other clutter would go a long way towards making this a better photo.', '2006-08-09 20:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712296, 375817, 43191, '<td valign="top">The red and green work well together. Composition is good and the cute factor wins me over. :)</td>', 'The red and green work well together. Composition is good and the cute factor wins me over. :)', '2006-08-09 20:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712297, 373825, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lot of blown out highlights here and some really harsh shadows to boot.  Composition is a bit rough as there''s nothing here that grabs your attention.  I think the main problem with this photo is it appears to have been shot at a very bright time of day.  Another possibility for improvement would be crouching down and getting a good view of the kids face who is carrying the baby.  What''s that look?  Resignation?  Distraction?  Duty?  Whatever it is it would add a lot to this photo by way of giving me something to think about and draw my own conclusions from.</td>', 'Lot of blown out highlights here and some really harsh shadows to boot.  Composition is a bit rough as there''s nothing here that grabs your attention.  I think the main problem with this photo is it appears to have been shot at a very bright time of day.  Another possibility for improvement would be crouching down and getting a good view of the kids face who is carrying the baby.  What''s that look?  Resignation?  Distraction?  Duty?  Whatever it is it would add a lot to this photo by way of giving me something to think about and draw my own conclusions from.', '2006-08-09 20:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712298, 374438, 43191, '<td valign="top">As no doubt you''ve already heard, you need to make it bigger. Putting that aside, I like the retro feel of the shot.</td>', 'As no doubt you''ve already heard, you need to make it bigger. Putting that aside, I like the retro feel of the shot.', '2006-08-09 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712299, 375871, 61818, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t care for the lsd inspired post processing in the least.  A lot of nice reflections here that might have been interesting.  Looks like the sky might be blown out but who can tell given the extreme color shifts here.  I think this could have been a nice shot.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t care for the lsd inspired post processing in the least.  A lot of nice reflections here that might have been interesting.  Looks like the sky might be blown out but who can tell given the extreme color shifts here.  I think this could have been a nice shot.', '2006-08-09 20:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712301, 376701, 43191, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2006-08-09 20:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712304, 375063, 43191, '<td valign="top">This is great. The orange of the lone ferry against all that blue works so well.</td>', 'This is great. The orange of the lone ferry against all that blue works so well.', '2006-08-09 20:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712305, 377224, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lot of train jammed into this photo.  At the same time, a lot of the front of it has been cropped out.  This train has a really interesting front.  A circle that looks almost like a clock, that nice bright red strip with the yellow lettering and two black circles on it.  Even the little latern sitting in front of the smokestack is unique.  Focusing in on these things, tightening up the shot, would make for a more interesting photo.  You''d also lose the big piece of blown out background in the upper left.</td>', 'Lot of train jammed into this photo.  At the same time, a lot of the front of it has been cropped out.  This train has a really interesting front.  A circle that looks almost like a clock, that nice bright red strip with the yellow lettering and two black circles on it.  Even the little latern sitting in front of the smokestack is unique.  Focusing in on these things, tightening up the shot, would make for a more interesting photo.  You''d also lose the big piece of blown out background in the upper left.', '2006-08-09 20:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712307, 376467, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections on the water.  This shot begs to be retaken at sundown.</td>', 'I like the reflections on the water.  This shot begs to be retaken at sundown.', '2006-08-09 20:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712308, 373987, 63768, '<td valign="top">i like it. it is ver artistic and idk even no how to do that u have talent in you slevs</td>', 'i like it. it is ver artistic and idk even no how to do that u have talent in you slevs', '2006-08-09 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712310, 376519, 61818, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Shot is a bit out of focus and there is some sort of colored noise beneath the bug and around that antenna.  Borders rarely work, and this is no exception.  I do think this uniquely meets the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Shot is a bit out of focus and there is some sort of colored noise beneath the bug and around that antenna.  Borders rarely work, and this is no exception.  I do think this uniquely meets the challenge.', '2006-08-09 20:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712314, 376635, 61818, '<td valign="top">This shot would benefit from increased contrast and saturation.  I think your title detracts greatly from this photo.  First, it is no mystery at all how that plane is involved in transportation and/or the science behind how it moves around.  So right there I''m struck by a flawed bit of logic.  This is a good photo in the sense that it combines two very odd subjects.  Let the viewer draw their own conclusions.</td>', 'This shot would benefit from increased contrast and saturation.  I think your title detracts greatly from this photo.  First, it is no mystery at all how that plane is involved in transportation and/or the science behind how it moves around.  So right there I''m struck by a flawed bit of logic.  This is a good photo in the sense that it combines two very odd subjects.  Let the viewer draw their own conclusions.', '2006-08-09 20:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712315, 377417, 61818, '<td valign="top">Too dark, out of focus, etc.  Cool looking car, might try crouching down and shooting it from a bit below so it looks like it is roaring off the page at you.</td>', 'Too dark, out of focus, etc.  Cool looking car, might try crouching down and shooting it from a bit below so it looks like it is roaring off the page at you.', '2006-08-09 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712317, 377388, 51793, '<td valign="top">There are two white spots on the image, lens dust. Should have burned this out. Gave you 7</td>', 'There are two white spots on the image, lens dust. Should have burned this out. Gave you 7', '2006-08-09 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712319, 377468, 51793, '<td valign="top">Too blury for my taste and no WOW factor. There needs to be something that really stands out here.</td>', 'Too blury for my taste and no WOW factor. There needs to be something that really stands out here.', '2006-08-09 20:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712320, 374701, 61818, '<td valign="top">Great dof, nice light, good pose.  Nothing bad to say here really, nice shot.</td>', 'Great dof, nice light, good pose.  Nothing bad to say here really, nice shot.', '2006-08-09 20:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712321, 377295, 51793, '<td valign="top">That is a crazy looking image. Too much fish eye I would say.</td>', 'That is a crazy looking image. Too much fish eye I would say.', '2006-08-09 20:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712324, 377254, 51793, '<td valign="top">I like this old look.</td>', 'I like this old look.', '2006-08-09 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712325, 376464, 61818, '<td valign="top">Like the sepia effect.  Think it could use some increased contrast.  Nice looking antique car.</td>', 'Like the sepia effect.  Think it could use some increased contrast.  Nice looking antique car.', '2006-08-09 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712329, 375964, 51793, '<td valign="top">A little dark for me but a great idea.</td>', 'A little dark for me but a great idea.', '2006-08-09 20:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712332, 377160, 51793, '<td valign="top">Not to ghostly but it is a nice looking train.</td>', 'Not to ghostly but it is a nice looking train.', '2006-08-09 20:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
