(2712335, 375505, 61818, '<td valign="top">Would have worked better getting up close on the guy building his ship.  The reflections are nice but really have nothing to do with the focus of the shot and just distract.  nice lighting on his face, looks like there might be something interesting in that model he''s concentrating on.  Get up there so I can see it better.</td>', 'Would have worked better getting up close on the guy building his ship.  The reflections are nice but really have nothing to do with the focus of the shot and just distract.  nice lighting on his face, looks like there might be something interesting in that model he''s concentrating on.  Get up there so I can see it better.', '2006-08-09 20:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712339, 376535, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I like the colors on the background but I guess that''s not really your work heh.  Nice timing capturing the face in the window.</td>', 'Very creative.  I like the colors on the background but I guess that''s not really your work heh.  Nice timing capturing the face in the window.', '2006-08-09 20:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712341, 375880, 51793, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the original for this one. I see that it has been validated but I still don''t see it. Can you send it to me? Gave you a 10 for confusion</td>', 'I would like to see the original for this one. I see that it has been validated but I still don''t see it. Can you send it to me? Gave you a 10 for confusion', '2006-08-09 20:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712342, 377618, 52599, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love the interpretation of ''transportation'' in your subject.</td>', 'This is great! I love the interpretation of ''transportation'' in your subject.', '2006-08-09 20:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712343, 373995, 61818, '<td valign="top">Would be a better photo imo without half of it showing the dull concrete.  Man Stretching - show the man stretching.  Very hard to discern him amid the massive amounts of gray here.</td>', 'Would be a better photo imo without half of it showing the dull concrete.  Man Stretching - show the man stretching.  Very hard to discern him amid the massive amounts of gray here.', '2006-08-09 20:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712348, 373910, 52599, '<td valign="top">What a find! Good angle and crop.</td>', 'What a find! Good angle and crop.', '2006-08-09 20:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712352, 375962, 52599, '<td valign="top">I think this could be more dramatic cropping out the lines....but the tone and angle are great!</td>', 'I think this could be more dramatic cropping out the lines....but the tone and angle are great!', '2006-08-09 20:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712357, 376521, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I like the train filling the entire frame, and the texture of the cieling.</td>', 'Great photo.  I like the train filling the entire frame, and the texture of the cieling.', '2006-08-09 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712361, 377517, 63267, '<td valign="top">Excellent BW coversion.  Good contrast and tones.</td>', 'Excellent BW coversion.  Good contrast and tones.', '2006-08-09 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712365, 376482, 52599, '<td valign="top">Perfect macro...good comp, I really enjoy this shot.....9</td>', 'Perfect macro...good comp, I really enjoy this shot.....9', '2006-08-09 21:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712373, 375596, 52599, '<td valign="top">The photo is a little hot in the treeline, but the clarity, comp and overall sweetness make this a very nice shot :)</td>', 'The photo is a little hot in the treeline, but the clarity, comp and overall sweetness make this a very nice shot :)', '2006-08-09 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712375, 377084, 52599, '<td valign="top">What a fun-colored find! The white border was a good choice here, and the clarity of the colors stand out brilliantly.</td>', 'What a fun-colored find! The white border was a good choice here, and the clarity of the colors stand out brilliantly.', '2006-08-09 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712377, 376455, 52599, '<td valign="top">At this age, I was not yet brave enough to turn my head and hold on with one hand! Very nice tones, an overall sweet photo.</td>', 'At this age, I was not yet brave enough to turn my head and hold on with one hand! Very nice tones, an overall sweet photo.', '2006-08-09 21:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712380, 377424, 58785, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W work. I like the composition, the sun... very well done.. 9</td>', 'Very nice B&W work. I like the composition, the sun... very well done.. 9', '2006-08-09 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712382, 376349, 52599, '<td valign="top">A little bit wider crop on the left, but the composition is fantastic...your timing was great with this.</td>', 'A little bit wider crop on the left, but the composition is fantastic...your timing was great with this.', '2006-08-09 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712383, 376072, 52599, '<td valign="top">I like the tones...this strikes me as a very crisp, clean shot. :)</td>', 'I like the tones...this strikes me as a very crisp, clean shot. :)', '2006-08-09 21:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
