(2712915, 376463, 63601, '<td valign="top">I find the over-exposed background distracting. But I really like the sense of motion conveyed by the girl''s expression. Perhaps a bit more of the bike in the crop would bring that out a little more.</td>', 'I find the over-exposed background distracting. But I really like the sense of motion conveyed by the girl''s expression. Perhaps a bit more of the bike in the crop would bring that out a little more.', '2006-08-09 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
