(2713451, 377575, 63267, '<td valign="top">If the window didn''t clip the girls face I would like this picture a lot more.  I like it for the composition, especially the old man looking down (wonder what he is looking at???), but I can''t get over the clipped face.</td>', 'If the window didn''t clip the girls face I would like this picture a lot more.  I like it for the composition, especially the old man looking down (wonder what he is looking at???), but I can''t get over the clipped face.', '2006-08-10 02:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713453, 377534, 63267, '<td valign="top">You forgot to show the bycicle playing card strapped to the frame to give that motor sound....great picture, I like the detail in the rusted nut that shows the rounded corner from too many vice-grip tightenings!</td>', 'You forgot to show the bycicle playing card strapped to the frame to give that motor sound....great picture, I like the detail in the rusted nut that shows the rounded corner from too many vice-grip tightenings!', '2006-08-10 02:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713456, 377546, 63267, '<td valign="top">A 32 Ford coupe, with a Chevy sign in the background.  I like the car and you and photographed it well. The BW conversion looks nice, but I can''t get over that Chevy sign....</td>', 'A 32 Ford coupe, with a Chevy sign in the background.  I like the car and you and photographed it well. The BW conversion looks nice, but I can''t get over that Chevy sign....', '2006-08-10 02:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713462, 377452, 63267, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  I think the composotion, exposure and BW conversion are great.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  I think the composotion, exposure and BW conversion are great.', '2006-08-10 02:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713467, 374230, 63267, '<td valign="top">Man that sun is really in your face!  The picture popped up and I turned my head away!  Looks like a miserable drive with a shiny wet road and traffic to contend with, not to mention the glaring sun!</td>', 'Man that sun is really in your face!  The picture popped up and I turned my head away!  Looks like a miserable drive with a shiny wet road and traffic to contend with, not to mention the glaring sun!', '2006-08-10 02:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
