(2717133, 374438, 16004, '<td valign="top">as soon as this popped up, i thought, wow, like it!  i love the small proportions of the picture; usually a small picture looks a bit dopey compared to all the other submissions, but this time it just looks completely right.  i love the tight crop, approve of the high contrast, and generally just love it.  the title is perfect too - it really does have a happy demeanour and style...  feels like a nod to happier times and era''s, really.  excellent picture, and kudos on the bravery regarding the size.  10.</td>', 'as soon as this popped up, i thought, wow, like it!  i love the small proportions of the picture; usually a small picture looks a bit dopey compared to all the other submissions, but this time it just looks completely right.  i love the tight crop, approve of the high contrast, and generally just love it.  the title is perfect too - it really does have a happy demeanour and style...  feels like a nod to happier times and era''s, really.  excellent picture, and kudos on the bravery regarding the size.  10.', '2006-08-11 09:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717143, 373910, 16004, '<td valign="top">a bit more care in the crop and rotate thing is needed here!  a derelict old bus always makes good subject matter, and it has been captured well here - the sad feeling of abandonment is really strong.  slight criticisms is that i kind of wish the sky wasn''t as dull as it is, i feel for something like this stepping back a bit more to show of the environment might be nice, and the angle is a bit conventional to truely stand out head and shoulders above the others.  but it is steeped in mood, fits the challenge, and i like the post processing.  7.</td>', 'a bit more care in the crop and rotate thing is needed here!  a derelict old bus always makes good subject matter, and it has been captured well here - the sad feeling of abandonment is really strong.  slight criticisms is that i kind of wish the sky wasn''t as dull as it is, i feel for something like this stepping back a bit more to show of the environment might be nice, and the angle is a bit conventional to truely stand out head and shoulders above the others.  but it is steeped in mood, fits the challenge, and i like the post processing.  7.', '2006-08-11 09:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717163, 377384, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like this one a lot.  i love how the joint in the rear panels is right along the horizon of the background; genius bit of timing that.  this also a picture that really rewards the longer viewing, there''s so much to it.  i love how the sky is reflected, and the road in a slightly distorted way.  composition is really good too - just off to the side, allowing us to see the road and traffic coming the other way works well; interesting to look at but not distracting.  i do wish it was advanced editing so you could clone yourself out of it (guessing it''s a honda cr-v?).  nice, feels very road movie.  8.</td>', 'i like this one a lot.  i love how the joint in the rear panels is right along the horizon of the background; genius bit of timing that.  this also a picture that really rewards the longer viewing, there''s so much to it.  i love how the sky is reflected, and the road in a slightly distorted way.  composition is really good too - just off to the side, allowing us to see the road and traffic coming the other way works well; interesting to look at but not distracting.  i do wish it was advanced editing so you could clone yourself out of it (guessing it''s a honda cr-v?).  nice, feels very road movie.  8.', '2006-08-11 09:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717168, 377231, 16004, '<td valign="top">mazda appears to be the choice motor for dpcers!  the unconventional angle and crop makes it interesting, but oddly it''s a harder to take in visually.  the background and environment is very uninspiring though, and kind of lessens the overall appeal.  5.</td>', 'mazda appears to be the choice motor for dpcers!  the unconventional angle and crop makes it interesting, but oddly it''s a harder to take in visually.  the background and environment is very uninspiring though, and kind of lessens the overall appeal.  5.', '2006-08-11 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
