(2717262, 376485, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s kinda dark and I can''t really tell what it is...trains? But, it made me think and wonder and in my mind makes it totally creative...nice job!</td>', 'It''s kinda dark and I can''t really tell what it is...trains? But, it made me think and wonder and in my mind makes it totally creative...nice job!', '2006-08-11 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717267, 377461, 62187, '<td valign="top">A little bit over-exposed but you got the creative part right. I think most people missed that part. Nice job!</td>', 'A little bit over-exposed but you got the creative part right. I think most people missed that part. Nice job!', '2006-08-11 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717271, 376521, 16004, '<td valign="top">really cool great stuff.  the roof is astonishingly gorgeous, almost like a pencil drawing.  it''s very metropolis and stylish, which is only enhanced by the shadow cast by the train.  the train itself is nicely blurred, and i like that it seems totally devoid of humans (as is the platform) which adds a certain menace about it.  i think i might have cropped half an inch off the bottom, but other than that, this is really super.  10.</td>', 'really cool great stuff.  the roof is astonishingly gorgeous, almost like a pencil drawing.  it''s very metropolis and stylish, which is only enhanced by the shadow cast by the train.  the train itself is nicely blurred, and i like that it seems totally devoid of humans (as is the platform) which adds a certain menace about it.  i think i might have cropped half an inch off the bottom, but other than that, this is really super.  10.', '2006-08-11 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717272, 377341, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the photo but you got some creativity going on here. Thanks and good luck to ya!</td>', 'I don''t really like the photo but you got some creativity going on here. Thanks and good luck to ya!', '2006-08-11 10:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
