(2717329, 377492, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I like it a lot. Thanks for being creative! 10</td>', 'Very nice...I like it a lot. Thanks for being creative! 10', '2006-08-11 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717335, 377254, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is like the perfect land rover shot.  other than just cropping below the skyline, i don''t think i would have done anything different in your shoes.  i love how the environment is very much a part of the vehicle; it''s not just transportation, it''s character!  10.</td>', 'this is like the perfect land rover shot.  other than just cropping below the skyline, i don''t think i would have done anything different in your shoes.  i love how the environment is very much a part of the vehicle; it''s not just transportation, it''s character!  10.', '2006-08-11 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717371, 375371, 16004, '<td valign="top">SO completely in two minds about this!  by rights this sort of editting should make a photo stink, but, by gods, it works!  i think it would be more effective if the cars weren''t in the shot, and the background is uninspiringly dull to say the least, but the actually trolley and road surface and yellow lines all work together very effectively.  the way the trolley glows with a yellow halo makes it seem, well, almost holy in a biblical manner.  i can hear choirs of angels going "laaa!".  8.</td>', 'SO completely in two minds about this!  by rights this sort of editting should make a photo stink, but, by gods, it works!  i think it would be more effective if the cars weren''t in the shot, and the background is uninspiringly dull to say the least, but the actually trolley and road surface and yellow lines all work together very effectively.  the way the trolley glows with a yellow halo makes it seem, well, almost holy in a biblical manner.  i can hear choirs of angels going "laaa!".  8.', '2006-08-11 11:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
