(2717828, 376110, 16004, '<td valign="top">i had given this an 8.  i suspect you''re gonna get hammered for the blur, i personally feel it adds a sense of realism, drama, urgency, and makes it all the more dynamic. it almost feels like one of those scoop spy shots you see published.  i love that there are very few real colours in this picture, that the silvers and greys go together really very well.  well done.</td>', 'i had given this an 8.  i suspect you''re gonna get hammered for the blur, i personally feel it adds a sense of realism, drama, urgency, and makes it all the more dynamic. it almost feels like one of those scoop spy shots you see published.  i love that there are very few real colours in this picture, that the silvers and greys go together really very well.  well done.', '2006-08-11 13:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
