(2718367, 376394, 60850, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  I think of a tractor as more of a tool than transportation (kind of like a riding lawn mower), but I''ve seen farmers driving them to the store before!  7</td>', 'I really like this photo.  I think of a tractor as more of a tool than transportation (kind of like a riding lawn mower), but I''ve seen farmers driving them to the store before!  7', '2006-08-11 16:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718375, 377605, 60850, '<td valign="top">I think this a great subject for this challenge.  I think I would have liked it better if you backed up a bit or maybe just didn''t crop it as tight on the right.  Also, the focus seems to be on the wheel/grass and less on the body (maybe it''s just me).  Still, a really nice photo with great dof.</td>', 'I think this a great subject for this challenge.  I think I would have liked it better if you backed up a bit or maybe just didn''t crop it as tight on the right.  Also, the focus seems to be on the wheel/grass and less on the body (maybe it''s just me).  Still, a really nice photo with great dof.', '2006-08-11 16:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
