(2718395, 377546, 60850, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and really cool photo.  I don''t know if you intentionally captured the Chevy sign in the background of your Ford picture or not.  Pretty cool either way, but I might have liked it a little better without the other cars.</td>', 'Nice angle and really cool photo.  I don''t know if you intentionally captured the Chevy sign in the background of your Ford picture or not.  Pretty cool either way, but I might have liked it a little better without the other cars.', '2006-08-11 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
