(2718474, 376518, 60850, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I think it would have been better with a less busy background and maybe at an angle where you could also see the lines of the modern vehicle attached to that mirror.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I think it would have been better with a less busy background and maybe at an angle where you could also see the lines of the modern vehicle attached to that mirror.', '2006-08-11 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718505, 376295, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  The focus is nice the natural light is a bit harsh and I wish there were a little more contrast depth but I love the ambience of the image and how 1940''s it looks to me.  I immediately was drawn into the photo and made a connection and that always overrules any issues I see in the technical department.  Great idea, fits the challenge well, really made a connection so I gave an 8</td>', 'Excellent capture.  The focus is nice the natural light is a bit harsh and I wish there were a little more contrast depth but I love the ambience of the image and how 1940''s it looks to me.  I immediately was drawn into the photo and made a connection and that always overrules any issues I see in the technical department.  Great idea, fits the challenge well, really made a connection so I gave an 8', '2006-08-11 17:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718512, 377381, 11923, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  I love the richness of the black, the white is not too bright as to overwhelm, instead it offsets the deep black perfectly.  The composition is great, excellent focus, just a great image all around.  I kind of wish there was some sort of more substantial border just to make it have that finished/framed look, but that''s just gravy.  Nicely captured.  I am upping from an 8 to a 9 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  I love the richness of the black, the white is not too bright as to overwhelm, instead it offsets the deep black perfectly.  The composition is great, excellent focus, just a great image all around.  I kind of wish there was some sort of more substantial border just to make it have that finished/framed look, but that''s just gravy.  Nicely captured.  I am upping from an 8 to a 9 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718518, 377388, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity here.  The rich colors are wonderful.  You''ve made what could have been a boring, flat photo of some sandals into something worth investing more than a few seconds looking at.  I love the richness of the various brown shades.  The background looks more brown than black to me too so that''s a nice difference as well.  The composition is interesting, nice and simple yet allows the shoes to show off their details nicely.  Definitely fits the challenge in my estimation.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Wonderful clarity here.  The rich colors are wonderful.  You''ve made what could have been a boring, flat photo of some sandals into something worth investing more than a few seconds looking at.  I love the richness of the various brown shades.  The background looks more brown than black to me too so that''s a nice difference as well.  The composition is interesting, nice and simple yet allows the shoes to show off their details nicely.  Definitely fits the challenge in my estimation.  Well done.  8', '2006-08-11 17:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718531, 374637, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the movement and freshness of this image.  The lighting is a bit bright with the white of those bikemobiles but luckily I don''t think it harms the image at all.  I''m enjoying the engaging street scene, nice and urban but fun with your capture.  I also like how it looks tilted.  Typically I would not like an non-uniform border but in this case I like how it gives it a letterbox(is that the right word?) format almost as if I''m watching a widescreen movie.  The focus is good though I wish I could see the faces of the drivers.  I gave a 7</td>', 'I like the movement and freshness of this image.  The lighting is a bit bright with the white of those bikemobiles but luckily I don''t think it harms the image at all.  I''m enjoying the engaging street scene, nice and urban but fun with your capture.  I also like how it looks tilted.  Typically I would not like an non-uniform border but in this case I like how it gives it a letterbox(is that the right word?) format almost as if I''m watching a widescreen movie.  The focus is good though I wish I could see the faces of the drivers.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-11 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718537, 374254, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in this image.  It seems a bit subdued to me, perhaps a polarizer was used?  I like the fact that you can tell its a sunny day but the whites are not going crazy and there is some nice details on the boats still visible.  The sky looks interesting and organic, it is a nice foil for the more rigid shapes of the boat masts too.  I think I might like this even better if the blue was just a shade deeper/darker, as it is I did give it a 7</td>', 'I like the lines in this image.  It seems a bit subdued to me, perhaps a polarizer was used?  I like the fact that you can tell its a sunny day but the whites are not going crazy and there is some nice details on the boats still visible.  The sky looks interesting and organic, it is a nice foil for the more rigid shapes of the boat masts too.  I think I might like this even better if the blue was just a shade deeper/darker, as it is I did give it a 7', '2006-08-11 17:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718549, 377525, 45375, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition', '2006-08-11 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718553, 375871, 11923, '<td valign="top">This may not be for many people but it instantly caught my attention.  I love the tone in this, I''m not sure if a filter was used to grab those wonderful purple colors or how that was accomplished but it has a very abstract/modern neon thing going that I think really really works with the explosion of shapes you''ve captured here.  The clarity is great, nice use of the natural light and I love composition for the most part.  The one thing I do wish is that it could''ve been composed so that gap in the top where the trees aren''t cover was not there - either they''d be visible through the window/reflected in something else so they have the purple/yellow toning too or just composed so they aren''t in the image at all.  Still that''s a fairly minor issue.  I''m bumping up from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'This may not be for many people but it instantly caught my attention.  I love the tone in this, I''m not sure if a filter was used to grab those wonderful purple colors or how that was accomplished but it has a very abstract/modern neon thing going that I think really really works with the explosion of shapes you''ve captured here.  The clarity is great, nice use of the natural light and I love composition for the most part.  The one thing I do wish is that it could''ve been composed so that gap in the top where the trees aren''t cover was not there - either they''d be visible through the window/reflected in something else so they have the purple/yellow toning too or just composed so they aren''t in the image at all.  Still that''s a fairly minor issue.  I''m bumping up from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 17:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718562, 377315, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice and simple image.  Tells a story in the rough condition of both the shoes and the skateboard.  I like how the skateboard looks older instead of one of those fancypants things (could just be my perception of course) so that helps futher the idea of it being in use for a long time.  There''s some great lines and shapes here as well.  I''ve just a couple nitpicks, I wish there was more contrast to the image and that the DOF was just a bit deeper.  Other than that, nicely done.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Very nice and simple image.  Tells a story in the rough condition of both the shoes and the skateboard.  I like how the skateboard looks older instead of one of those fancypants things (could just be my perception of course) so that helps futher the idea of it being in use for a long time.  There''s some great lines and shapes here as well.  I''ve just a couple nitpicks, I wish there was more contrast to the image and that the DOF was just a bit deeper.  Other than that, nicely done.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-11 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718573, 373823, 11923, '<td valign="top">I definitely like this, the silver and water droplets are very interesting.  All of the coloring goes well together and the shapes are what really bring my eye into the image.  There are a few issues I do have with it though.  The left side is cropped in way too much, it needs some breathing room at least equal to the right side.  The line along the bottom that is partially cropped out is also distracting, if there was a way to evenly remove it without crowding the bottom of the image or to include it in its entirety, I''d like it better.  Finally there seems to be a slight tilt to the image, that could just be my perception but there it is all the same!  The focus seems just a tiny bit soft too.  I like the way the lighting is coming from one side and yet not creating too harsh of shadows.  Catches the water droplets nicely.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'I definitely like this, the silver and water droplets are very interesting.  All of the coloring goes well together and the shapes are what really bring my eye into the image.  There are a few issues I do have with it though.  The left side is cropped in way too much, it needs some breathing room at least equal to the right side.  The line along the bottom that is partially cropped out is also distracting, if there was a way to evenly remove it without crowding the bottom of the image or to include it in its entirety, I''d like it better.  Finally there seems to be a slight tilt to the image, that could just be my perception but there it is all the same!  The focus seems just a tiny bit soft too.  I like the way the lighting is coming from one side and yet not creating too harsh of shadows.  Catches the water droplets nicely.  I gave a 6.', '2006-08-11 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718577, 377517, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Black &amp; white with deep contrasts.  Wonderful.  I like the pattern of masts and the negative space at the bottom.  I think shaving a smidge off of the bottom (maybe half an inch) would still keep the open feeling yet compress the image just slightly.  You''ve kept the natural light under control here and it really works to the image''s advantage since its making the contrasts so apparent.  Very nicely captured.  I gave a 7</td>', 'I love it.  Black & white with deep contrasts.  Wonderful.  I like the pattern of masts and the negative space at the bottom.  I think shaving a smidge off of the bottom (maybe half an inch) would still keep the open feeling yet compress the image just slightly.  You''ve kept the natural light under control here and it really works to the image''s advantage since its making the contrasts so apparent.  Very nicely captured.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-11 17:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718579, 374642, 17837, '<td valign="top">ugh man, who''s ever car that is, they need to be taking better care of it...</td>', 'ugh man, who''s ever car that is, they need to be taking better care of it...', '2006-08-11 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718591, 377174, 11923, '<td valign="top">I find the title amusing.  I think this is an excellent capture.  I''m guessing its a candid and if so, its lovely (even if it isn''t).  The contrasts are perfect, great choice of B&amp;W and the focus is excellent.  I like the fact you''ve controlled the light here so nothing is overwhelming.  I think the composition is great except I do wish the tire wasn''t cut off at the bottom and there was just a bit more breathing room at the top so she didn''t look cramped in the picture.  Other than that though I think this is wonderful.  I''m bumping from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'I find the title amusing.  I think this is an excellent capture.  I''m guessing its a candid and if so, its lovely (even if it isn''t).  The contrasts are perfect, great choice of B&W and the focus is excellent.  I like the fact you''ve controlled the light here so nothing is overwhelming.  I think the composition is great except I do wish the tire wasn''t cut off at the bottom and there was just a bit more breathing room at the top so she didn''t look cramped in the picture.  Other than that though I think this is wonderful.  I''m bumping from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 17:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718602, 375848, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I think the pastel colors are great, gives a wonderful soft feeling to the image.  I like the inclusion of the antennae tower, good foil for the balloon.. technology versus an example of a simple mode of travel.  The colors contrast nicely with one another, that green is beautifully vibrant against the peachy-pink sky.  The image looks a bit Neat Imaged to me, which is alright but sometimes ends up plasticking images up, it may not be NI''d at all but that immediately came to mind when I was looking at the relationship of the balloon to the sky.  A very nice photo, I gave a 7</td>', 'Lovely!  I think the pastel colors are great, gives a wonderful soft feeling to the image.  I like the inclusion of the antennae tower, good foil for the balloon.. technology versus an example of a simple mode of travel.  The colors contrast nicely with one another, that green is beautifully vibrant against the peachy-pink sky.  The image looks a bit Neat Imaged to me, which is alright but sometimes ends up plasticking images up, it may not be NI''d at all but that immediately came to mind when I was looking at the relationship of the balloon to the sky.  A very nice photo, I gave a 7', '2006-08-11 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718612, 377406, 30392, '<td valign="top">Oh yes! This is one cool pic. I love the colors and composition. Good luck!</td>', 'Oh yes! This is one cool pic. I love the colors and composition. Good luck!', '2006-08-11 17:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718614, 376033, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image I could easily see as a print ad.  The clarity is excellent, the movement has been captured very well.  I love the motion trails (they add so much energy and light to this image) and would love to know how you made this all work out so well.  Excellent control of light and composition too.  I''d seriously see if you could get this used by the company somehow, you''ve really made your car look and feel energized and phenominal.  I''m bumping from a 7 to a 9 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image I could easily see as a print ad.  The clarity is excellent, the movement has been captured very well.  I love the motion trails (they add so much energy and light to this image) and would love to know how you made this all work out so well.  Excellent control of light and composition too.  I''d seriously see if you could get this used by the company somehow, you''ve really made your car look and feel energized and phenominal.  I''m bumping from a 7 to a 9 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718630, 375550, 30392, '<td valign="top">The best one so far, by a country mile! I''m not a fan of selective desaturation normally, but in your pic it works great. It looks so British! 10 from me.</td>', 'The best one so far, by a country mile! I''m not a fan of selective desaturation normally, but in your pic it works great. It looks so British! 10 from me.', '2006-08-11 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718635, 376517, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is one mean vehicle, does it fly too? Good pic, best of luck</td>', 'This is one mean vehicle, does it fly too? Good pic, best of luck', '2006-08-11 17:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718651, 376394, 30392, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic, I''ve always been fond of old tractors for some reason...</td>', 'Lovely pic, I''ve always been fond of old tractors for some reason...', '2006-08-11 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718667, 377377, 30392, '<td valign="top">Great colors and good composition, but a lot of noise even at this small size. It''s either because of a massive crop or too much post-processing</td>', 'Great colors and good composition, but a lot of noise even at this small size. It''s either because of a massive crop or too much post-processing', '2006-08-11 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718683, 377417, 16402, '<td valign="top">Way to dark, sorry.</td>', 'Way to dark, sorry.', '2006-08-11 18:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718690, 376485, 30392, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, it really conveys the feeling of desolation and left behind. I just wish it was a little bit sharper... (maybe just a post-processing issue) Good luck</td>', 'I like this one a lot, it really conveys the feeling of desolation and left behind. I just wish it was a little bit sharper... (maybe just a post-processing issue) Good luck', '2006-08-11 18:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718709, 374701, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully emotive.  I like the feeling of peace this image has.  The woman looks as though she''s taking a simple moment out of the very busy world (very nicely captured in the soft focused background).  I think the lighting is masterfully used here.  The bright bustling outdoors versus the quiet shadowed world inside the car.  The portion that really captures my eye is her forearm.  Its got a very nice tone and smoothness and really draws the eye up into her shadowed face.  I don''t know how this will be received by DPC at large, but I think this is one of the more subtle and simply perfectly captured images I''ve seen in awhile - it exudes a sense of isolation from the outside world so nicely.  Sure there are some slight areas of overly bright light in the background and the image could''ve been tilted slightly to the right to even out the horizontal line of the car door more, but I don''t think this suffers from those nitpicks at all.  This really drew me in and got me invested as a viewer, I hope others found the same things in it as I did.  I''m bumping from a 7 to a 9 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'Wonderfully emotive.  I like the feeling of peace this image has.  The woman looks as though she''s taking a simple moment out of the very busy world (very nicely captured in the soft focused background).  I think the lighting is masterfully used here.  The bright bustling outdoors versus the quiet shadowed world inside the car.  The portion that really captures my eye is her forearm.  Its got a very nice tone and smoothness and really draws the eye up into her shadowed face.  I don''t know how this will be received by DPC at large, but I think this is one of the more subtle and simply perfectly captured images I''ve seen in awhile - it exudes a sense of isolation from the outside world so nicely.  Sure there are some slight areas of overly bright light in the background and the image could''ve been tilted slightly to the right to even out the horizontal line of the car door more, but I don''t think this suffers from those nitpicks at all.  This really drew me in and got me invested as a viewer, I hope others found the same things in it as I did.  I''m bumping from a 7 to a 9 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718713, 377230, 39880, '<td valign="top">Yup, I know that feeling.  Nice sense of humor for a nice shot.</td>', 'Yup, I know that feeling.  Nice sense of humor for a nice shot.', '2006-08-11 18:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718719, 377608, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Bold.  Strong.  I love the lighting, the B&amp;W, the implied texture.  I think it looks great centered, the silver tone is fantastic.  I''d actually shave off about half an inche to an inch off the top, but that''s just playing around with it - it looks great as is.  I love the shadow and light play.  Very nicely captured.  I gave am bumping from a 7 to an 8.</td>', 'Simple.  Bold.  Strong.  I love the lighting, the B&W, the implied texture.  I think it looks great centered, the silver tone is fantastic.  I''d actually shave off about half an inche to an inch off the top, but that''s just playing around with it - it looks great as is.  I love the shadow and light play.  Very nicely captured.  I gave am bumping from a 7 to an 8.', '2006-08-11 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718730, 377160, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity for the most part - the font of the engine looks a bit soft.  Love the black/white versus the color - looks like selective desaturation and I think it works here (though I don''t know if the desaturation worked out evenly, seems some color bits here and there).  Nice composition and control of the light.  Great capture.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Excellent clarity for the most part - the font of the engine looks a bit soft.  Love the black/white versus the color - looks like selective desaturation and I think it works here (though I don''t know if the desaturation worked out evenly, seems some color bits here and there).  Nice composition and control of the light.  Great capture.  I gave a 7', '2006-08-11 18:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718742, 376033, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very showroom elegance - one of the best I''ve seen here!  Good work.</td>', 'Very showroom elegance - one of the best I''ve seen here!  Good work.', '2006-08-11 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718744, 375964, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very dark, kind of sulking.  Nice abstract.  I like the dark tones with the hint of color up at the top corner.  The silhouette/shadowed plants add some nice texture and interest  to the image.  The boat is perfectly placed - I like the off-center tilt.  This is very gritty and has a quiet that really screams out at you - if that makes sense?  It is understated yet makes you pay attention to it.  I think its gorgeous, very reminiscent of an old painting in my mind.  I love the way the light plays off the water as well.  Very very nicely photographed/post-processed.  I''m bumping from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.</td>', 'Very dark, kind of sulking.  Nice abstract.  I like the dark tones with the hint of color up at the top corner.  The silhouette/shadowed plants add some nice texture and interest  to the image.  The boat is perfectly placed - I like the off-center tilt.  This is very gritty and has a quiet that really screams out at you - if that makes sense?  It is understated yet makes you pay attention to it.  I think its gorgeous, very reminiscent of an old painting in my mind.  I love the way the light plays off the water as well.  Very very nicely photographed/post-processed.  I''m bumping from a 7 to an 8 and adding a favorite.', '2006-08-11 18:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718746, 376178, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, DNMC.</td>', 'Sorry, DNMC.', '2006-08-11 18:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718749, 377505, 16402, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting boat shots.</td>', 'One of the more interesting boat shots.', '2006-08-11 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718753, 374701, 42792, '<td valign="top">Nice how this is more a sentiment conveyed of the challenge theme rather than a literal depiction. 8 for that.</td>', 'Nice how this is more a sentiment conveyed of the challenge theme rather than a literal depiction. 8 for that.', '2006-08-11 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718758, 374639, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, very nice detailing, the light is a bit harsh and bright, but it did allow for the details of the wheel/wagon to come through.  I think the composition needs a little bit of a fix.  The wheel looks rather cramped and is cut off in places, wish it were more prominent and intact.  I do think the grass adds a nice bit of color that breaks up all the brown, but it also draws the eye away from the subject.  Overall I gave a 6</td>', 'Great clarity, very nice detailing, the light is a bit harsh and bright, but it did allow for the details of the wheel/wagon to come through.  I think the composition needs a little bit of a fix.  The wheel looks rather cramped and is cut off in places, wish it were more prominent and intact.  I do think the grass adds a nice bit of color that breaks up all the brown, but it also draws the eye away from the subject.  Overall I gave a 6', '2006-08-11 18:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718768, 377312, 41746, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much, the  use of negative space, the beautiful fog against the colorful luggage on the bikes. Works very vell. Great capture. 9.</td>', 'I like this one very much, the  use of negative space, the beautiful fog against the colorful luggage on the bikes. Works very vell. Great capture. 9.', '2006-08-11 18:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718777, 377452, 42792, '<td valign="top">Almost feel the fluidity in this photo.  Very nice b&amp;w tones.</td>', 'Almost feel the fluidity in this photo.  Very nice b&w tones.', '2006-08-11 18:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718781, 375596, 11923, '<td valign="top">very nice emotive image.  Classical look to it, I like the lighting - though bright in the trees.  The sepia I''m not so sure about.  Would be interesting to see this with other tones applied, B&amp;W, maybe a blue or a richer brown/red.  Not sure if any others would necessarily work but though I do like the representation of the different shades of brown I''m not sure if the flatness of the color overall is a plus to this particular image.  There also seems to be a weird.. crease? of distortion/artifacting running through the center of this image.  No idea if that''s just issues from uploading or if I''m the only one to see it, but it is distracting (no other photo I''ve seens so far had it though).  Regardless I gave a 6 over all.</td>', 'very nice emotive image.  Classical look to it, I like the lighting - though bright in the trees.  The sepia I''m not so sure about.  Would be interesting to see this with other tones applied, B&W, maybe a blue or a richer brown/red.  Not sure if any others would necessarily work but though I do like the representation of the different shades of brown I''m not sure if the flatness of the color overall is a plus to this particular image.  There also seems to be a weird.. crease? of distortion/artifacting running through the center of this image.  No idea if that''s just issues from uploading or if I''m the only one to see it, but it is distracting (no other photo I''ve seens so far had it though).  Regardless I gave a 6 over all.', '2006-08-11 18:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718788, 376521, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very nice blend of lines and shapes with the lines of the moving train.  Really emphasizes the fluidity of this transport mode.</td>', 'Very nice blend of lines and shapes with the lines of the moving train.  Really emphasizes the fluidity of this transport mode.', '2006-08-11 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718789, 376280, 11923, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, has some good focus and nice composition.  Would''ve liked the leaf to be more centered in the corner so the bit of black at the bottom wasn''t showing.  The lighting is nice and bright but it feels very harsh to me.  The colors are nice, perhaps they''ve been boosted though?  They have a slight unnatural feeling to them.  I really like the idea behind this and its been rendered very well.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Meets the challenge, has some good focus and nice composition.  Would''ve liked the leaf to be more centered in the corner so the bit of black at the bottom wasn''t showing.  The lighting is nice and bright but it feels very harsh to me.  The colors are nice, perhaps they''ve been boosted though?  They have a slight unnatural feeling to them.  I really like the idea behind this and its been rendered very well.  I gave a 6', '2006-08-11 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2718807, 376971, 41746, '<td valign="top">Very strong image, perfect title for this shot. I like how you have captured the rush and the colors are awesome. Good luck! 9.</td>', 'Very strong image, perfect title for this shot. I like how you have captured the rush and the colors are awesome. Good luck! 9.', '2006-08-11 18:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
