(2720092, 376960, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  You did an excellent job of composing this picture, with plenty of roadway towards the back of the image to show where the child it headed towards.  This picture could benefit from a little sharpening, as it is hard to find a good sharply focused edge on the bike rider.  Nice job and Im bumping this up.</td>', 'Back to comment.  You did an excellent job of composing this picture, with plenty of roadway towards the back of the image to show where the child it headed towards.  This picture could benefit from a little sharpening, as it is hard to find a good sharply focused edge on the bike rider.  Nice job and Im bumping this up.', '2006-08-12 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720100, 377116, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow of the bike and the rack on the roadway and colors look very natural.  There is a bit too much negative space on the right that doesn''t really add to the image.  There are two solutions to correct the negative space.  First, give this image a square crop and just remove it.  Second, this would require reshooting so not as likely, include more of the bus in the image and maybe a rider boarding if possible.</td>', 'I like the shadow of the bike and the rack on the roadway and colors look very natural.  There is a bit too much negative space on the right that doesn''t really add to the image.  There are two solutions to correct the negative space.  First, give this image a square crop and just remove it.  Second, this would require reshooting so not as likely, include more of the bus in the image and maybe a rider boarding if possible.', '2006-08-12 08:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720108, 376107, 61679, '<td valign="top">The subject matter meets the challenge and is interesting in it''s own right but there are several issues with this picture that are going to hurt your score.  The shadows are harsh and hide all of the detail in what ever he is riding.  The background is busy and all the signs indicate he should be heading in the opposite direction.  Basically, the image looks like you stumbled across the subject matter and took a quick snapshoot..</td>', 'The subject matter meets the challenge and is interesting in it''s own right but there are several issues with this picture that are going to hurt your score.  The shadows are harsh and hide all of the detail in what ever he is riding.  The background is busy and all the signs indicate he should be heading in the opposite direction.  Basically, the image looks like you stumbled across the subject matter and took a quick snapshoot..', '2006-08-12 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720110, 377303, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I like the lighting and the color of your image.  I think your score is going to suffer a bit because of the noise and the centering of the main subject.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I like the lighting and the color of your image.  I think your score is going to suffer a bit because of the noise and the centering of the main subject.', '2006-08-12 09:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720112, 375848, 61679, '<td valign="top">Have to bump this to a 10.  I assume you took this while riding in a hot air ballon.  Wow!</td>', 'Have to bump this to a 10.  I assume you took this while riding in a hot air ballon.  Wow!', '2006-08-12 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720117, 375625, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  The subject you choose is not the strongest subject for this challenge.  The image lacks a strong focal point to draw the viewer''s attention.  If you look at the image closely, all of the rule of third nodes have nothing with real detail to command attention.  The focus isn''t the best, as the only place I can find that is sharply focused is the edges of the green car and since that is located near the edge of the image, it leads the viewer''s eyes out of the image instead of holding their interest.</td>', 'Back to comment.  The subject you choose is not the strongest subject for this challenge.  The image lacks a strong focal point to draw the viewer''s attention.  If you look at the image closely, all of the rule of third nodes have nothing with real detail to command attention.  The focus isn''t the best, as the only place I can find that is sharply focused is the edges of the green car and since that is located near the edge of the image, it leads the viewer''s eyes out of the image instead of holding their interest.', '2006-08-12 09:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720120, 377417, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  I''m sure other commentors have mentioned that this image is a bit on the dark side.  Although the subject meets the challenge, there is nothing in this picture to hold the view''s attention for any length of time.</td>', 'Back to comment.  I''m sure other commentors have mentioned that this image is a bit on the dark side.  Although the subject meets the challenge, there is nothing in this picture to hold the view''s attention for any length of time.', '2006-08-12 09:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720138, 377084, 47842, '<td valign="top">very nice colors!</td>', 'very nice colors!', '2006-08-12 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720147, 375802, 47842, '<td valign="top">i think colored or sepia would have been better</td>', 'i think colored or sepia would have been better', '2006-08-12 09:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720150, 374636, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo with interesting lights and darkened sky but I guess we all bit miss that transport :).8</td>', 'Lovely photo with interesting lights and darkened sky but I guess we all bit miss that transport :).8', '2006-08-12 09:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720152, 377303, 27524, '<td valign="top">Lovely calm water and rising mist...picture that sets mood.</td>', 'Lovely calm water and rising mist...picture that sets mood.', '2006-08-12 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720155, 376656, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like how you use differend angle to capture serfing...that big wave makes it real interesting and then ofcourse beautiful sunset.</td>', 'I like how you use differend angle to capture serfing...that big wave makes it real interesting and then ofcourse beautiful sunset.', '2006-08-12 09:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720160, 377315, 27524, '<td valign="top">Simple and tastful capture...though I would prefer bit wider focus and more on skateboard then shoe.</td>', 'Simple and tastful capture...though I would prefer bit wider focus and more on skateboard then shoe.', '2006-08-12 09:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
