(2720165, 375848, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its very beautiful and I like your composition but the colors of baloon really sets me off. I would probably try a bit of desaturation.</td>', 'Its very beautiful and I like your composition but the colors of baloon really sets me off. I would probably try a bit of desaturation.', '2006-08-12 09:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
