(2720197, 376718, 27524, '<td valign="top">For the first its defenetly orighinal photo, lovely colors and composition. Just wonder why the sky looks so grainy. Still good shot.</td>', 'For the first its defenetly orighinal photo, lovely colors and composition. Just wonder why the sky looks so grainy. Still good shot.', '2006-08-12 10:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
