(2720669, 374701, 41200, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think there were two ways that would have improved this image. 1) You could have exposed for light falling on her face &amp; let the exterior get blown out. (I would probably convert to B&amp;W for that option)or 2) Ask her to lean closer to the window so that the light on her face was closer to that on her forearm. The''s a nice mood to this image. Overall, well done.</td>', 'I like this, but I think there were two ways that would have improved this image. 1) You could have exposed for light falling on her face & let the exterior get blown out. (I would probably convert to B&W for that option)or 2) Ask her to lean closer to the window so that the light on her face was closer to that on her forearm. The''s a nice mood to this image. Overall, well done.', '2006-08-12 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
