(2720797, 377385, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think what people are going to want to see is more contrast with the white against the dark background. As it is now, it sorta blends in and nothing really stands out. I like that you caught the two pods flying away. I hope this photo doesn''t suffer the wrath of the "doesn''t meet challenge" brigade. I think the idea is very much "Transportation."</td>', 'I think what people are going to want to see is more contrast with the white against the dark background. As it is now, it sorta blends in and nothing really stands out. I like that you caught the two pods flying away. I hope this photo doesn''t suffer the wrath of the "doesn''t meet challenge" brigade. I think the idea is very much "Transportation."', '2006-08-12 15:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
