(2720923, 376000, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this works in color. Your sky is blown and your greens take over. <br/> <br/>A crop suggestion:<br/>Drag from the top of the first lightpole (cutting it out of the photo) down to the 3rd road line and drag over cutting out some of the right side. <br/> <br/>This gets rid of a lot of that overwhelming green and blown out sky. It also gets rid of the chopped light pole and brings you closer to your subject while still carrying you through the photo with the road lines.</td>', 'I don''t think this works in color. Your sky is blown and your greens take over.  A crop suggestion:Drag from the top of the first lightpole (cutting it out of the photo) down to the 3rd road line and drag over cutting out some of the right side.  This gets rid of a lot of that overwhelming green and blown out sky. It also gets rid of the chopped light pole and brings you closer to your subject while still carrying you through the photo with the road lines.', '2006-08-12 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720924, 376998, 58114, '<td valign="top">thats a great shot.<br/>The people in the background disturb the situation a little bit.<br/>What''s about some cropping ?</td>', 'thats a great shot.The people in the background disturb the situation a little bit.What''s about some cropping ?', '2006-08-12 16:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
