(2720977, 376482, 22689, '<td valign="top">This one inmediatly catched my eye and after a look at all the photos in this challenge , this is my favorite !<br/>The colors , composition , dof are excellent ; my vote : 10</td>', 'This one inmediatly catched my eye and after a look at all the photos in this challenge , this is my favorite !The colors , composition , dof are excellent ; my vote : 10', '2006-08-12 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721049, 375371, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''ll come straight out and say that I don''t like this in terms of something I"d put on my wall.  I do like that you did a more daring PP than is often seen in challenges.  I like the vibrancy of the colors and the focus looks good.  I think I''d prefer the image was cropped more, crop out the black car and the yellow line on the far right.  Its an interesting take on the challenge and while I don''t find the overall affect very appealing I''m glad I saw it.  Bumping from a 4 to a 5.</td>', 'I''ll come straight out and say that I don''t like this in terms of something I"d put on my wall.  I do like that you did a more daring PP than is often seen in challenges.  I like the vibrancy of the colors and the focus looks good.  I think I''d prefer the image was cropped more, crop out the black car and the yellow line on the far right.  Its an interesting take on the challenge and while I don''t find the overall affect very appealing I''m glad I saw it.  Bumping from a 4 to a 5.', '2006-08-12 18:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721078, 374554, 40088, '<td valign="top">nice picture, that''s a really old one, I wonder where you found it.</td>', 'nice picture, that''s a really old one, I wonder where you found it.', '2006-08-12 18:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721085, 376528, 11923, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge and has a potentially interesting subject.  The lighting seems a bit muted and so there are a lot of details on the train that are being missed.  The focus looks a bit soft/mottled as well - this could be because of the lighting too.  I think the composition is good, there''s a number of areas for the eye to rest on but I think the low light doesn''t enhance that aspect.  I gave a 4</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge and has a potentially interesting subject.  The lighting seems a bit muted and so there are a lot of details on the train that are being missed.  The focus looks a bit soft/mottled as well - this could be because of the lighting too.  I think the composition is good, there''s a number of areas for the eye to rest on but I think the low light doesn''t enhance that aspect.  I gave a 4', '2006-08-12 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721259, 377310, 61552, '<td valign="top">This shot tells a story!  I like it!  Makes me wonder why the owner didn''t find a way to get it home.  It makes me think, so I gove you a 9.  Great scenery, too.  Good job!</td>', 'This shot tells a story!  I like it!  Makes me wonder why the owner didn''t find a way to get it home.  It makes me think, so I gove you a 9.  Great scenery, too.  Good job!', '2006-08-12 20:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
