(2721570, 377468, 44086, '<td valign="top">This kind of picture works better when the subject is frozen. Work of firing while continuosly moving the camera in a smooth arc. It looks like you were trying that but the moment you hit the shutter you stopped your motion. Follow through.</td>', 'This kind of picture works better when the subject is frozen. Work of firing while continuosly moving the camera in a smooth arc. It looks like you were trying that but the moment you hit the shutter you stopped your motion. Follow through.', '2006-08-13 00:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
