(2721785, 373927, 45475, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. I think a curve adjustment layer may have helped get rid of the faint haze, but nonetheless a magical scene and an ideal challenge entry. 8</td>', 'Nicely captured. I think a curve adjustment layer may have helped get rid of the faint haze, but nonetheless a magical scene and an ideal challenge entry. 8', '2006-08-13 02:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
