(2722193, 376135, 27524, '<td valign="top">I must say its very interesting object but your angle makes it bit flat and non atractive. I would go for more closeup and bit lower angle. Could also desaturate the green background to make more accent on red clay.</td>', 'I must say its very interesting object but your angle makes it bit flat and non atractive. I would go for more closeup and bit lower angle. Could also desaturate the green background to make more accent on red clay.', '2006-08-13 09:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722197, 376463, 27524, '<td valign="top">I really like the white bacground and overall pink color but the girl itself looks or oversharpened or too much postprocessing.</td>', 'I really like the white bacground and overall pink color but the girl itself looks or oversharpened or too much postprocessing.', '2006-08-13 09:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722202, 376349, 27524, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse seems as interesting object of your picture but composition is bit too busy. Attention is splitted between too many object from which non is really the ''central''. Also capturing from long distance causes sometimes problems with focus.</td>', 'The lighthouse seems as interesting object of your picture but composition is bit too busy. Attention is splitted between too many object from which non is really the ''central''. Also capturing from long distance causes sometimes problems with focus.', '2006-08-13 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
