(2722205, 376277, 27524, '<td valign="top">The lights at dark are real nice but you did bit too much contrast to accent them. The sky looks still nice but ground for sure too black. Maybe could get better effect playing with curves.</td>', 'The lights at dark are real nice but you did bit too much contrast to accent them. The sky looks still nice but ground for sure too black. Maybe could get better effect playing with curves.', '2006-08-13 10:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
