(2722217, 374588, 32507, '<td valign="top">There just seems to be too much blur here.  The mans face is even blurred.  I think if you could have one solid subject in the photo if would accentuate the movement of others a lot better.</td>', 'There just seems to be too much blur here.  The mans face is even blurred.  I think if you could have one solid subject in the photo if would accentuate the movement of others a lot better.', '2006-08-13 10:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
