(2722348, 374980, 51793, '<td valign="top">Where is the rest of the car?</td>', 'Where is the rest of the car?', '2006-08-13 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722352, 377264, 51793, '<td valign="top">Back ground isn''t exactly right and you could have focused more on the side of the car vs. the back bumper. I only say this because I attend and photograph many car shows and I have the car pictures down pretty good. I love the Z though it''s a sweet car and I love the power as you stomp the gas. Vrooooooommmmmmmmmmmm</td>', 'Back ground isn''t exactly right and you could have focused more on the side of the car vs. the back bumper. I only say this because I attend and photograph many car shows and I have the car pictures down pretty good. I love the Z though it''s a sweet car and I love the power as you stomp the gas. Vrooooooommmmmmmmmmmm', '2006-08-13 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722358, 374591, 46330, '<td valign="top">This has all the makings of a very nice shot. I just don''t like the car being bisected by the deep shadow.  If you want it emerging from the shadows I would have just the nose in the light and use a bit of fill flash to lighten the rear of the car to bring out more detail.</td>', 'This has all the makings of a very nice shot. I just don''t like the car being bisected by the deep shadow.  If you want it emerging from the shadows I would have just the nose in the light and use a bit of fill flash to lighten the rear of the car to bring out more detail.', '2006-08-13 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722363, 377240, 46330, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to say here.  At this size it''s very difficult to really evaluate the image.  The composition looks OK, but the overall image is very soft.</td>', 'Not sure what to say here.  At this size it''s very difficult to really evaluate the image.  The composition looks OK, but the overall image is very soft.', '2006-08-13 11:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722370, 377306, 51793, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting. I really like this.</td>', 'Perfect lighting. I really like this.', '2006-08-13 11:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722372, 376522, 46330, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea and I really like the composition, but the bright spot from the sun on her forehead is blown out and draws the eye and the face is a bit soft.  It looks like the camera may have focused on her ear and hair.  The tree branch is also a bit of a distraction, though obviously in this case cropping would have ruined the composition and with basic editing you couldn''t clone it out.</td>', 'Not a bad idea and I really like the composition, but the bright spot from the sun on her forehead is blown out and draws the eye and the face is a bit soft.  It looks like the camera may have focused on her ear and hair.  The tree branch is also a bit of a distraction, though obviously in this case cropping would have ruined the composition and with basic editing you couldn''t clone it out.', '2006-08-13 12:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722373, 376033, 51793, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I have always loved these types of pictures. I think they are so neat.</td>', 'Nice picture. I have always loved these types of pictures. I think they are so neat.', '2006-08-13 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722376, 376635, 51793, '<td valign="top">wow. kinda neat.</td>', 'wow. kinda neat.', '2006-08-13 12:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722378, 377468, 46330, '<td valign="top">Well composed and nice colors but just not sharp enough.  This could have benefitted from a faster shutter speed or a burst of flash.  Alternatively, if you wanted some blur to imply motion then you needad a longer shutter speed to pan with to make your intention more obvious.</td>', 'Well composed and nice colors but just not sharp enough.  This could have benefitted from a faster shutter speed or a burst of flash.  Alternatively, if you wanted some blur to imply motion then you needad a longer shutter speed to pan with to make your intention more obvious.', '2006-08-13 12:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722380, 377487, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think that the fence takes a lot away from this image and I think that if you would have blured the fence more it would have been better. It is just to eye distracting.</td>', 'I think that the fence takes a lot away from this image and I think that if you would have blured the fence more it would have been better. It is just to eye distracting.', '2006-08-13 12:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722384, 374772, 51793, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of transportation going on here.</td>', 'There is a lot of transportation going on here.', '2006-08-13 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722385, 374438, 51793, '<td valign="top">This looks like you took this with a phone camera.</td>', 'This looks like you took this with a phone camera.', '2006-08-13 12:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722387, 374633, 46330, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, but not a lot here to hold interest.  Maybe you could have tried a different arrangement of the feet with them all pointing in towards the center?</td>', 'Well exposed, but not a lot here to hold interest.  Maybe you could have tried a different arrangement of the feet with them all pointing in towards the center?', '2006-08-13 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722388, 377563, 51793, '<td valign="top">You can see that this was a hot day.</td>', 'You can see that this was a hot day.', '2006-08-13 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722391, 376718, 51793, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA gave you a 10 because this is funny. I like this idea.</td>', 'HAHAHA gave you a 10 because this is funny. I like this idea.', '2006-08-13 12:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722393, 375871, 46330, '<td valign="top">It''s always worthwhile experimenting, but this one just doesn''t seem to work for me.</td>', 'It''s always worthwhile experimenting, but this one just doesn''t seem to work for me.', '2006-08-13 12:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722394, 377295, 46330, '<td valign="top">To each his own here I guess, but this just doesn''t seem like a very good choice of subject for a fisheye image.  Maybe it would be better from a front or rear view?</td>', 'To each his own here I guess, but this just doesn''t seem like a very good choice of subject for a fisheye image.  Maybe it would be better from a front or rear view?', '2006-08-13 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722395, 376030, 51793, '<td valign="top">Not many chances to get this picture huh? It''s blury but the idea is a good one.</td>', 'Not many chances to get this picture huh? It''s blury but the idea is a good one.', '2006-08-13 12:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722396, 374705, 51793, '<td valign="top">SWEET!!!</td>', 'SWEET!!!', '2006-08-13 12:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722397, 375287, 46330, '<td valign="top">Nice truck, but I''d like to see a bit more sharpness, and it wouldn''t hurt to crop out the white curb on the bottom as it keeps attracting the eye and distracting from the truck.</td>', 'Nice truck, but I''d like to see a bit more sharpness, and it wouldn''t hurt to crop out the white curb on the bottom as it keeps attracting the eye and distracting from the truck.', '2006-08-13 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722398, 377516, 51793, '<td valign="top">Did you put the leaves in the spokes?</td>', 'Did you put the leaves in the spokes?', '2006-08-13 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722402, 375745, 46330, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the overall image is soft and the lighting is rather harsh.</td>', 'Nice composition but the overall image is soft and the lighting is rather harsh.', '2006-08-13 12:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722406, 375203, 46330, '<td valign="top">Interesting vehicle, but the crop does nothing for it, especially the amputated nose.</td>', 'Interesting vehicle, but the crop does nothing for it, especially the amputated nose.', '2006-08-13 12:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722411, 376317, 51793, '<td valign="top">Your USM is too much it looks like. There is a outline of the horse that is eye catching and I don''t think that you wanted this to happen.</td>', 'Your USM is too much it looks like. There is a outline of the horse that is eye catching and I don''t think that you wanted this to happen.', '2006-08-13 12:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722412, 376678, 51793, '<td valign="top">Nice butt. hahah image is a little choppy but right away my eyes went to her butt.</td>', 'Nice butt. hahah image is a little choppy but right away my eyes went to her butt.', '2006-08-13 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722413, 377616, 46330, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the main subject in the frame and good job stopping the motion.  Unfortunately he''s lost in the tree behind him and he''s underexposed.    A move to your left would have put him against a clean background of sky and a small burst of flash would have evened out your exposure to allow both him and the sky to be properly exposed.</td>', 'Nice placement of the main subject in the frame and good job stopping the motion.  Unfortunately he''s lost in the tree behind him and he''s underexposed.    A move to your left would have put him against a clean background of sky and a small burst of flash would have evened out your exposure to allow both him and the sky to be properly exposed.', '2006-08-13 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722415, 376052, 51793, '<td valign="top">hahahha.</td>', 'hahahha.', '2006-08-13 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722417, 376643, 46330, '<td valign="top">A good job placing him coming into the frame, but it just lacks any sharpness or definition and this really seems more of a sport than a mode of transportation.</td>', 'A good job placing him coming into the frame, but it just lacks any sharpness or definition and this really seems more of a sport than a mode of transportation.', '2006-08-13 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722420, 374554, 51793, '<td valign="top">The chain pulls away from the bike but I am still going to give you a 9 becausee I really like the image. If it wasn''t chained up it would have been a 10 all the way.</td>', 'The chain pulls away from the bike but I am still going to give you a 9 becausee I really like the image. If it wasn''t chained up it would have been a 10 all the way.', '2006-08-13 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722422, 376969, 46330, '<td valign="top">Color and sharpness are good, but I really don''t know what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Color and sharpness are good, but I really don''t know what I''m looking at.', '2006-08-13 12:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722426, 376455, 51793, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but why is she wearing rain boots when it isn''t raining outside?</td>', 'Cute picture but why is she wearing rain boots when it isn''t raining outside?', '2006-08-13 12:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722431, 376221, 51793, '<td valign="top">From this picture I would say that you are a magician. I see the coins with holes in them, is this for a cigarette through a coin trick?</td>', 'From this picture I would say that you are a magician. I see the coins with holes in them, is this for a cigarette through a coin trick?', '2006-08-13 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2722432, 375296, 46330, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but it looks like it was shot around high noon.  The shadows under the bridge are completely black and the water and sky are burnt out.  Just too much dynamic range for your sensor to record.</td>', 'Interesting subject but it looks like it was shot around high noon.  The shadows under the bridge are completely black and the water and sky are burnt out.  Just too much dynamic range for your sensor to record.', '2006-08-13 12:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
