(2722727, 377417, 39484, '<td valign="top">From a DPC point of view, this will probably not fair very well because it is overly dark and not too sharp.  I like it because the lack of tonal range creates intrigue and draws the eye in, in a way that is appropriate with the content of the image. nice job. 10</td>', 'From a DPC point of view, this will probably not fair very well because it is overly dark and not too sharp.  I like it because the lack of tonal range creates intrigue and draws the eye in, in a way that is appropriate with the content of the image. nice job. 10', '2006-08-13 15:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
