(2724739, 375287, 16004, '<td valign="top">interestingly different vehicle (landies have lots of character, i feel) and i like its yellowness, but i think this picture is suffering a bit from not having the car tack sharp, and also have it''s bum cropped off.  also, the smallness of the picture doesn''t really serve the subject very well. 4.</td>', 'interestingly different vehicle (landies have lots of character, i feel) and i like its yellowness, but i think this picture is suffering a bit from not having the car tack sharp, and also have it''s bum cropped off.  also, the smallness of the picture doesn''t really serve the subject very well. 4.', '2006-08-14 07:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724747, 376033, 43660, '<td valign="top">wow! this is so excellent!</td>', 'wow! this is so excellent!', '2006-08-14 07:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724771, 377608, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a great, gorgeous picture, which has really been enhanced by your post processing treatment.  just eye candy really.  the grain is really effective and the detail on the chrome bit is lovely.  i can''t offer any real criticism because it''s really great.  though, oddly, i think this might have been enhanced a bit with a border.  anyway, really nice - 9</td>', 'this is a great, gorgeous picture, which has really been enhanced by your post processing treatment.  just eye candy really.  the grain is really effective and the detail on the chrome bit is lovely.  i can''t offer any real criticism because it''s really great.  though, oddly, i think this might have been enhanced a bit with a border.  anyway, really nice - 9', '2006-08-14 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724923, 374588, 33515, '<td valign="top">Nice motion and the colors are great, if only that guy would keep his head still. 10</td>', 'Nice motion and the colors are great, if only that guy would keep his head still. 10', '2006-08-14 09:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
