(2724950, 377312, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the mood created by the mist.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the mood created by the mist.  Good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724954, 374633, 32378, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I can tell some thought went into the shot, with the matching ankle bracelets.  Just not a real interesting image.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I can tell some thought went into the shot, with the matching ankle bracelets.  Just not a real interesting image.', '2006-08-14 09:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724957, 374701, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice!  i love the yellow tones and grainy feel of the picture, it feels cinematic, very elegant and rather stylish.  it''s just a great example of excellent composition, really.  the other cab encroaching on our view really enhances the bustle and new yorkness of the scene - lot''s of lovely elements.  9.</td>', 'nice!  i love the yellow tones and grainy feel of the picture, it feels cinematic, very elegant and rather stylish.  it''s just a great example of excellent composition, really.  the other cab encroaching on our view really enhances the bustle and new yorkness of the scene - lot''s of lovely elements.  9.', '2006-08-14 09:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724959, 375596, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I like the mood created by the photo alot.  Tells a good story with good composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I like the mood created by the photo alot.  Tells a good story with good composition.  Good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724961, 376551, 32378, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective in this shot.  Too bad this couldn''t be shot at a different time of day so back ground wasn''t so hazy looking.</td>', 'Interesting perspective in this shot.  Too bad this couldn''t be shot at a different time of day so back ground wasn''t so hazy looking.', '2006-08-14 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724964, 376277, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter and it meets the challenge.  Seems a little too saturated for me.</td>', 'I like the subject matter and it meets the challenge.  Seems a little too saturated for me.', '2006-08-14 09:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724966, 377385, 16004, '<td valign="top">hmmm.  transportation isn''t really the same as something being transported...  i dunno - does wind qualify?  it''s nicely captured, though i think it''s a little on the dark side; the colours feel a bit dull (i think the background is a bit bland and overpoweringly black).  4.</td>', 'hmmm.  transportation isn''t really the same as something being transported...  i dunno - does wind qualify?  it''s nicely captured, though i think it''s a little on the dark side; the colours feel a bit dull (i think the background is a bit bland and overpoweringly black).  4.', '2006-08-14 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724968, 377527, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it is different than what you would normally see in a picture of bikes.  I like the hi key approach and applaud you for attempting it in a challenge.  Composition is very good.  good luck.</td>', 'I like this shot because it is different than what you would normally see in a picture of bikes.  I like the hi key approach and applaud you for attempting it in a challenge.  Composition is very good.  good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724969, 376633, 16004, '<td valign="top">the post processing on this has led to the image looking (to me) really flat and not particularly inspiring, even though the name / badge you have captured is steeped in world-changing history.  the border feels odd too, for some reason.  4.</td>', 'the post processing on this has led to the image looking (to me) really flat and not particularly inspiring, even though the name / badge you have captured is steeped in world-changing history.  the border feels odd too, for some reason.  4.', '2006-08-14 09:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724972, 374141, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you had for this shot.  The colors work nicely.  Too bad you didn''t pick a pole with less things around it.  The bike tends to lead the eye into the photo, but since the bike is at rest with no rider I would have liked to have seen the entire bike.</td>', 'I like the idea you had for this shot.  The colors work nicely.  Too bad you didn''t pick a pole with less things around it.  The bike tends to lead the eye into the photo, but since the bike is at rest with no rider I would have liked to have seen the entire bike.', '2006-08-14 09:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724974, 377417, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is too dark for me to see much detail or create any particular mood.</td>', 'This is too dark for me to see much detail or create any particular mood.', '2006-08-14 09:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724976, 376986, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here.  good luck.</td>', 'I like what you did here.  good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724977, 376678, 16004, '<td valign="top">this feels very, very much like a painting, but it the style suits the subject matter, and it adds a greater degree of interest.  composition and colours are a treat, and the boat in the background adds to rather than detracts from the shot.  i''m deeply impressed at the moment you caught this; her posture is so dynamic, and the way she''s riding the wave is actually arty itself.  10.</td>', 'this feels very, very much like a painting, but it the style suits the subject matter, and it adds a greater degree of interest.  composition and colours are a treat, and the boat in the background adds to rather than detracts from the shot.  i''m deeply impressed at the moment you caught this; her posture is so dynamic, and the way she''s riding the wave is actually arty itself.  10.', '2006-08-14 09:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724980, 374588, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this.  For me you captured the mood of an urban setting well.  A little on the harsh side but not too harsh.  good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  For me you captured the mood of an urban setting well.  A little on the harsh side but not too harsh.  good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724982, 375034, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the serenity of this picture.  Some may not like the post processing but I do.  good luck.</td>', 'I like the serenity of this picture.  Some may not like the post processing but I do.  good luck.', '2006-08-14 09:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724985, 374260, 63977, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully creative shot. Love it</td>', 'A wonderfully creative shot. Love it', '2006-08-14 09:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724986, 377365, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice, but i think a longer exposure would have made it a bit more dramatic giving longer streakier red lines.  the image is suffering a bit from the white spots right in the middle, and the buildings are too interestingly lit and divert attention from the road.  you need fewer things drawing the eye.  4.</td>', 'nice, but i think a longer exposure would have made it a bit more dramatic giving longer streakier red lines.  the image is suffering a bit from the white spots right in the middle, and the buildings are too interestingly lit and divert attention from the road.  you need fewer things drawing the eye.  4.', '2006-08-14 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724987, 377065, 32378, '<td valign="top">I would like this shot more if there were more contrast, just feels washed out.</td>', 'I would like this shot more if there were more contrast, just feels washed out.', '2006-08-14 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724994, 375964, 32378, '<td valign="top">Your shot held my attention and made me think (good).  May be too artsy for one of these challenges.</td>', 'Your shot held my attention and made me think (good).  May be too artsy for one of these challenges.', '2006-08-14 09:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2724997, 377492, 16004, '<td valign="top">i''d have cropped this more square from the bottom, keeping the same width.  the brighter lights in the corner are a major distraction, and the top left orange lights don''t really fit in.  otherwise, it''s a reasonably striking abstract shot; and the title is a rather lovely choice.  but for me, overall, it leaves me a bit cold.  sorry.  4.</td>', 'i''d have cropped this more square from the bottom, keeping the same width.  the brighter lights in the corner are a major distraction, and the top left orange lights don''t really fit in.  otherwise, it''s a reasonably striking abstract shot; and the title is a rather lovely choice.  but for me, overall, it leaves me a bit cold.  sorry.  4.', '2006-08-14 09:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2725003, 377399, 32378, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspecitve from low to the ground.  Think your angle though pulls my attention to the back tire and plate.  Not the most intersting parts of the bike.</td>', 'Interesting perspecitve from low to the ground.  Think your angle though pulls my attention to the back tire and plate.  Not the most intersting parts of the bike.', '2006-08-14 09:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2725007, 377493, 16004, '<td valign="top">doesn''t really say transportation to me, i''m afraid.  the purply blue painted brickwork is quite appealing (might have been tempted to crop above the red brick, thereby making more duotoney) but generally, it kind of lacks that wow factor to make it stand out. 4.</td>', 'doesn''t really say transportation to me, i''m afraid.  the purply blue painted brickwork is quite appealing (might have been tempted to crop above the red brick, thereby making more duotoney) but generally, it kind of lacks that wow factor to make it stand out. 4.', '2006-08-14 09:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
