(2726015, 377327, 62006, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset capture. Love the colors and placement of the boat.</td>', 'Very nice sunset capture. Love the colors and placement of the boat.', '2006-08-14 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726085, 374273, 16004, '<td valign="top">it certainly has a certain rustic charm about it...  i feel that it looks a bit grey and washed out though; if you have ps elements or similar play with the levels a bit (sliding the left most one in elements up a fair bit would make the darker shades richer and more defined). the mountainous setting looks really nice in a remote kind of way, which suits your subjects.  6.</td>', 'it certainly has a certain rustic charm about it...  i feel that it looks a bit grey and washed out though; if you have ps elements or similar play with the levels a bit (sliding the left most one in elements up a fair bit would make the darker shades richer and more defined). the mountainous setting looks really nice in a remote kind of way, which suits your subjects.  6.', '2006-08-14 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726126, 375035, 16004, '<td valign="top">the setting of the sun suits the nature of the shot very well.  in terms of pleasing voters, i have a sneaky suspicion that this might not do all that well - might be wrong and i hope i am because this is lovely in a warm heartfelt retrospective kind of way.  puts me in mind of clint eastwood directed film Perfect World, actually.  stylish, moody, and nothing in the shot would suggest that it was taken in any era later than fifty years ago.  composition is superb too; understated but effective.  9.</td>', 'the setting of the sun suits the nature of the shot very well.  in terms of pleasing voters, i have a sneaky suspicion that this might not do all that well - might be wrong and i hope i am because this is lovely in a warm heartfelt retrospective kind of way.  puts me in mind of clint eastwood directed film Perfect World, actually.  stylish, moody, and nothing in the shot would suggest that it was taken in any era later than fifty years ago.  composition is superb too; understated but effective.  9.', '2006-08-14 16:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726133, 377117, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and clarity.  The subject is strong and excellent use of DOF.  Very well done!</td>', 'Great sharpness and clarity.  The subject is strong and excellent use of DOF.  Very well done!', '2006-08-14 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726136, 377295, 16004, '<td valign="top">you''ve somehow made what was a very pretty car into something resembly a tacky limo!  i really don''t think the fisheye is the best sort of lens on this sort of subject ;at least not head on.  it does have the benefit of looking like nothing else though!  i like how sharp it is, and the clean whiteness of the car really shows between the sky and paviors.  the sunlight on the left is far too harsh, though, and the building on the left and the red car on the right distact some.  as does your reflection!  6.</td>', 'you''ve somehow made what was a very pretty car into something resembly a tacky limo!  i really don''t think the fisheye is the best sort of lens on this sort of subject ;at least not head on.  it does have the benefit of looking like nothing else though!  i like how sharp it is, and the clean whiteness of the car really shows between the sky and paviors.  the sunlight on the left is far too harsh, though, and the building on the left and the red car on the right distact some.  as does your reflection!  6.', '2006-08-14 16:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726138, 374701, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is definitely off of the beaten path for composition and the results are excellent.  Phenomenal contrast and color tones as well.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is definitely off of the beaten path for composition and the results are excellent.  Phenomenal contrast and color tones as well.  Excellent!', '2006-08-14 16:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726147, 376971, 42100, '<td valign="top">The motion blur on this makes this very difficult to look at for long periods of time.  I''m so going to need an aspirin after I get done enjoying this excellent photo.</td>', 'The motion blur on this makes this very difficult to look at for long periods of time.  I''m so going to need an aspirin after I get done enjoying this excellent photo.', '2006-08-14 16:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726150, 374254, 32581, '<td valign="top">Good one. I wish it was brighter.</td>', 'Good one. I wish it was brighter.', '2006-08-14 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726152, 376482, 42100, '<td valign="top">Original subject matter and a very well excuted photo.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Original subject matter and a very well excuted photo.  Nicely done!', '2006-08-14 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726159, 375848, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool photograph, definitely makes me wonder about what your vantage point was.  Well done!</td>', 'Very cool photograph, definitely makes me wonder about what your vantage point was.  Well done!', '2006-08-14 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726166, 377114, 32581, '<td valign="top">Good one.where is he going?</td>', 'Good one.where is he going?', '2006-08-14 17:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726180, 375327, 42100, '<td valign="top">I love the setting/rising sun light reflecting on the all the edges of the planes, makes a very dramatic photo.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the setting/rising sun light reflecting on the all the edges of the planes, makes a very dramatic photo.  Well done!', '2006-08-14 17:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726184, 377452, 42100, '<td valign="top">Incredible contrast to this great b&amp;w and excellent composition.  Not sure what I was thinking the first or second times trough...BUMPING!</td>', 'Incredible contrast to this great b&w and excellent composition.  Not sure what I was thinking the first or second times trough...BUMPING!', '2006-08-14 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726437, 373877, 57260, '<td valign="top">I actually like the composition of your''s better than mine.</td>', 'I actually like the composition of your''s better than mine.', '2006-08-14 18:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726584, 375671, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like this hazy day photo.  The subject really stands out on its own, and the faded background shows enviroment without being too busy.  Very well done!</td>', 'I like this hazy day photo.  The subject really stands out on its own, and the faded background shows enviroment without being too busy.  Very well done!', '2006-08-14 18:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726585, 377571, 59754, '<td valign="top">I like the sky a lot.  The highlights are a bit blown in lower left (and I''m sure everyone will mention it), but at the same time the baloon seems a bit underexposed.  So the lighting wasn''t on your side in this shot but you did pretty well despite that.  7</td>', 'I like the sky a lot.  The highlights are a bit blown in lower left (and I''m sure everyone will mention it), but at the same time the baloon seems a bit underexposed.  So the lighting wasn''t on your side in this shot but you did pretty well despite that.  7', '2006-08-14 18:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726594, 376110, 59754, '<td valign="top">This image is overall a bit blurry and as some say "flat".  Perhaps more post-processing (maybe high contrast) would have made this a ''good blurry shot'', but as it stands now this picture is too greyish.  I do like the framing however, which is the most important skill a photographer can have.</td>', 'This image is overall a bit blurry and as some say "flat".  Perhaps more post-processing (maybe high contrast) would have made this a ''good blurry shot'', but as it stands now this picture is too greyish.  I do like the framing however, which is the most important skill a photographer can have.', '2006-08-14 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726597, 375745, 59754, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed on the Tuk-Tuk (at least thats what they were called in Thailand), and a bit too soft overall as a result.  Also, the composition is rather flat and even bland.  Nothing really holds my interest.  It is a cool mode of transport though, and I doubt many others will submit it.</td>', 'A little over exposed on the Tuk-Tuk (at least thats what they were called in Thailand), and a bit too soft overall as a result.  Also, the composition is rather flat and even bland.  Nothing really holds my interest.  It is a cool mode of transport though, and I doubt many others will submit it.', '2006-08-14 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2726601, 376371, 59754, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed at the top, but good DOF.</td>', 'A bit overexposed at the top, but good DOF.', '2006-08-14 18:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
