(2727706, 377543, 63360, '<td valign="top">This is so serene!  I give it a 10.  FYI, those dark and light rays created by the sun and the clouds are called crepuscular rays.</td>', 'This is so serene!  I give it a 10.  FYI, those dark and light rays created by the sun and the clouds are called crepuscular rays.', '2006-08-15 01:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728116, 375668, 43115, '<td valign="top">I really <b>like</b> this photo.<br/> <br/>Your composition is great.  Your choice to go with black and white is great.  Traveling by bus usually has this gloomy, desolate connotation; your photo expresses that very, very well.<br/> <br/>I am sure you will get comments about the size, and while bigger is always better, this photo speaks strongly enough to me to give it a 10.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.</td>', 'I really like this photo. Your composition is great.  Your choice to go with black and white is great.  Traveling by bus usually has this gloomy, desolate connotation; your photo expresses that very, very well. I am sure you will get comments about the size, and while bigger is always better, this photo speaks strongly enough to me to give it a 10. Keep shooting.', '2006-08-15 04:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2728118, 376529, 43115, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening?  The detail is lost, the colors are wierd, etc.  This is a good concept, but the execution falls short.</td>', 'Too much sharpening?  The detail is lost, the colors are wierd, etc.  This is a good concept, but the execution falls short.', '2006-08-15 04:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
