(2728128, 376693, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines.  A bit abstract, but ok.  Something just feels a bit off on this one though.  I wonder if a yellower cast to the boat (?) would complement the blue sky better.  You could get that through post processing or just late evening sun.</td>', 'Great leading lines.  A bit abstract, but ok.  Something just feels a bit off on this one though.  I wonder if a yellower cast to the boat (?) would complement the blue sky better.  You could get that through post processing or just late evening sun.', '2006-08-15 04:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
