(2729373, 376349, 23913, '<td valign="top">good luck chicago... :O)<br/> <br/>it looks a little low res. and chunky to me as well as it was maybe taken to far in sharpening....but hey there''s the tour boat....lol<br/> <br/>the sail boats are staggered really well..its almost as if the image would be better with out (my beloved) light house as part of the compostion...<br/> <br/>bt i suspose it adds in it own way...would be cool with more popping colors....</td>', 'good luck chicago... :O) it looks a little low res. and chunky to me as well as it was maybe taken to far in sharpening....but hey there''s the tour boat....lol the sail boats are staggered really well..its almost as if the image would be better with out (my beloved) light house as part of the compostion... bt i suspose it adds in it own way...would be cool with more popping colors....', '2006-08-15 12:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729389, 374588, 23913, '<td valign="top">ahhh, i''ve found the artistic image from germany, that will in all probabillity (sp.) get lost in the shuffel between images that are less worthy to grace the same wall on which this might be hung...let alone the same page. please let my vote lend you some help in this matter little as it might be. good luck 10</td>', 'ahhh, i''ve found the artistic image from germany, that will in all probabillity (sp.) get lost in the shuffel between images that are less worthy to grace the same wall on which this might be hung...let alone the same page. please let my vote lend you some help in this matter little as it might be. good luck 10', '2006-08-15 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2729404, 377525, 23913, '<td valign="top">i don''t think so. but that is chicago....i almost when down for the tall ships to do a shot then i thought everyone will be doing that....hmm i gess if two is everyone i was right....anyhow.<br/> <br/>its a nice image the water has a very cyan cast that would be nicer if it were a deep blue..its all the the color adj.<br/> <br/>and the whites are pinkish...i''m gessing the reflected light from the city and setting sun made this cast.<br/> <br/>good luck....my opinion it isn''t quite as gripping as it needs to be to pull off a high placement but never the less good luck and don''t let my opinion dount you. 6</td>', 'i don''t think so. but that is chicago....i almost when down for the tall ships to do a shot then i thought everyone will be doing that....hmm i gess if two is everyone i was right....anyhow. its a nice image the water has a very cyan cast that would be nicer if it were a deep blue..its all the the color adj. and the whites are pinkish...i''m gessing the reflected light from the city and setting sun made this cast. good luck....my opinion it isn''t quite as gripping as it needs to be to pull off a high placement but never the less good luck and don''t let my opinion dount you. 6', '2006-08-15 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
