(2731832, 375848, 20462, '<td valign="top">an complement to cool, soothing colors.  but does one really transport by hot air balloon?  perhaps..  it is interesting, because personally I would have used some NI on the lower half...you didn''t and succeeded.</td>', 'an complement to cool, soothing colors.  but does one really transport by hot air balloon?  perhaps..  it is interesting, because personally I would have used some NI on the lower half...you didn''t and succeeded.', '2006-08-16 01:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731856, 376033, 20462, '<td valign="top">SCORE!!!.  Now this is transportation in style.  I think your "Action" shot singlehandedly motivates me to "go up" more often.  I always think this kind of shot speaks volumes about the quality of the photographer.  I bet in one year, we will say you are force to be reckoned with.  But at this point, I got ya by a few ribs........</td>', 'SCORE!!!.  Now this is transportation in style.  I think your "Action" shot singlehandedly motivates me to "go up" more often.  I always think this kind of shot speaks volumes about the quality of the photographer.  I bet in one year, we will say you are force to be reckoned with.  But at this point, I got ya by a few ribs........', '2006-08-16 01:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731861, 377381, 20462, '<td valign="top">so very close.  wonderfully captured.</td>', 'so very close.  wonderfully captured.', '2006-08-16 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731878, 377571, 20462, '<td valign="top">this is crazy.  i always have felt, and continue to, that an image which makes the viewer "discover" something is of the highest form.  This makes us discover.  Congratulations.....</td>', 'this is crazy.  i always have felt, and continue to, that an image which makes the viewer "discover" something is of the highest form.  This makes us discover.  Congratulations.....', '2006-08-16 01:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731880, 374715, 41008, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moviealien:</b></div><hr/><i> like the picture, hate your title, what could possibly make you think of oblivion on a plane </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oblivion can be considered to be a state of serene, mental cleanliness. The peacefullness of this image, or rather, this sight suggests oblivion in three major ways. First, it is clean and gentle, as one might expect a visual representation of oblivious thoughts to be represented. Secondly, the sensation that is induced by the sight incurs a state of oblivion on the viewer; upon viewing the soft, natural cloudscape, one becomes oblivious to the artificial feel of the cabin.<br/> <br/>Finally, when flying on a plane, one is oblivious to the world below them. Below those clouds could be a peaceful village, or a warring nation. We do not know; we are oblivious, cruising far too high in the air and at far too great a speed to notice.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by moviealien: like the picture, hate your title, what could possibly make you think of oblivion on a plane   Oblivion can be considered to be a state of serene, mental cleanliness. The peacefullness of this image, or rather, this sight suggests oblivion in three major ways. First, it is clean and gentle, as one might expect a visual representation of oblivious thoughts to be represented. Secondly, the sensation that is induced by the sight incurs a state of oblivion on the viewer; upon viewing the soft, natural cloudscape, one becomes oblivious to the artificial feel of the cabin. Finally, when flying on a plane, one is oblivious to the world below them. Below those clouds could be a peaceful village, or a warring nation. We do not know; we are oblivious, cruising far too high in the air and at far too great a speed to notice. ', '2006-08-16 01:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731947, 374705, 40370, '<td valign="top">Another respectful DPC moment. A Nikon D200 hour at least. Nice job racing into the top twenty.</td>', 'Another respectful DPC moment. A Nikon D200 hour at least. Nice job racing into the top twenty.', '2006-08-16 01:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2731949, 376656, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cutter:</b></div><hr/><i> you know, the picture is perfect, perhaps the best of your portfolio.  but is it transportation....no.  but your photography should be congratulated. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What he said. Rather amazing accomplishment to enter something completely DNMC yet still ribbon. Says alot about the appeal of this photo with voters.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cutter: you know, the picture is perfect, perhaps the best of your portfolio.  but is it transportation....no.  but your photography should be congratulated.   What he said. Rather amazing accomplishment to enter something completely DNMC yet still ribbon. Says alot about the appeal of this photo with voters.', '2006-08-16 01:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
