(2731963, 376517, 45375, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the comments!! We were having our county fair the week this challenge entry dates were. I didn''t even realize it was a challenge until after I had the pics of this creation. I didn''t figure it would do all that great, but that it was too unique not to put it in. I didn''t like the red barn either but the other pics had lots of old tractors or another shed in the background. Anyway...glad most people at least got a laugh out of it...I know I did! :-)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sammie:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks like something Red Green would build on his show The Red Green Show! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the comments!! We were having our county fair the week this challenge entry dates were. I didn''t even realize it was a challenge until after I had the pics of this creation. I didn''t figure it would do all that great, but that it was too unique not to put it in. I didn''t like the red barn either but the other pics had lots of old tractors or another shed in the background. Anyway...glad most people at least got a laugh out of it...I know I did! :-) Originally posted by Sammie: This looks like something Red Green would build on his show The Red Green Show! ', '2006-08-16 01:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
