(2732829, 375848, 25787, '<td valign="top">Thank You everybody for your great comments and votes.  I took this shot from a hill top, overlooking the valley fog.  The balloon came from the annual Speidie fest and Balloon rally, held in Binghamton every year.  The balloon was near the next hill top over, breaking through the morning fog.</td>', 'Thank You everybody for your great comments and votes.  I took this shot from a hill top, overlooking the valley fog.  The balloon came from the annual Speidie fest and Balloon rally, held in Binghamton every year.  The balloon was near the next hill top over, breaking through the morning fog.', '2006-08-16 08:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2732840, 376693, 28710, '<td valign="top">S T U N N I N G.<br/> <br/>absolutely worth every bit of work you put into it. I actually like the person in the shot. It really gives this pic a subtle hint of grandiose.<br/> <br/>I would have been the 12th ten on your list.</td>', 'S T U N N I N G. absolutely worth every bit of work you put into it. I actually like the person in the shot. It really gives this pic a subtle hint of grandiose. I would have been the 12th ten on your list.', '2006-08-16 08:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
