(2733373, 375848, 46294, '<td valign="top">..............................lovely!</td>', '..............................lovely!', '2006-08-16 11:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2733385, 377384, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice composition. my first impulse was that I wanted a tighter crop so that the truck would challenge the sky for dominance (the reflection in the truck is its own turbulent sky), but on second look this works, too. The uncentered square within a square is a pleasing composition, and the "horizons" match up.</td>', 'nice composition. my first impulse was that I wanted a tighter crop so that the truck would challenge the sky for dominance (the reflection in the truck is its own turbulent sky), but on second look this works, too. The uncentered square within a square is a pleasing composition, and the "horizons" match up.', '2006-08-16 11:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
