(2733517, 376701, 48890, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, the only one I gave a 10 in this challenge (although I only voted for 1/4 of the entries).  The squarish crop works well with the perspective leading into the middle of the frame.  The tilt works well, too.  The off-colours are actually an essential part of being in a subway, so don''t listen to them telling you to adjust colours.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, the only one I gave a 10 in this challenge (although I only voted for 1/4 of the entries).  The squarish crop works well with the perspective leading into the middle of the frame.  The tilt works well, too.  The off-colours are actually an essential part of being in a subway, so don''t listen to them telling you to adjust colours.', '2006-08-16 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
