(2733726, 376033, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow! Really awesome photo. It''s even better than my previous favorite, "Midnight Run" by C-town driver:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=82512" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/226/thumb/82512.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/226/thumb/82512.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/226/thumb/82512.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I''ve wanted to take a photo like this for a while, but my car has too many dents and stuff now for it to be nice enough for the shot. I wondered if Midnight Run had inspired you as well.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a fabulous image and the ribbon!</td>', 'Wow! Really awesome photo. It''s even better than my previous favorite, "Midnight Run" by C-town driver:  I''ve wanted to take a photo like this for a while, but my car has too many dents and stuff now for it to be nice enough for the shot. I wondered if Midnight Run had inspired you as well. Congrats on a fabulous image and the ribbon!', '2006-08-16 12:46:12.000000', NULL, 0),
