(2735122, 376628, 31815, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments. taking pictures of these guys was really hard this pic was actually taken with the 300mm lens and they were pretty far away then the picture was cropped. They flew overhead several time but they are so fast catching them in frame was impossible. i wish i could have caught a good close up because i could see the pilots from where i was watching.</td>', 'thanks for all the comments. taking pictures of these guys was really hard this pic was actually taken with the 300mm lens and they were pretty far away then the picture was cropped. They flew overhead several time but they are so fast catching them in frame was impossible. i wish i could have caught a good close up because i could see the pilots from where i was watching.', '2006-08-16 20:24:29.000000', NULL, 0),
