(2736072, 375880, 62095, '<td valign="top">Really surprised by the large number of low marks here - without even any comments.  How rubbish. I thought it was neat.  6 from me. Maybe people were annoyed because the left hand edge of the "box" goes wonky.</td>', 'Really surprised by the large number of low marks here - without even any comments.  How rubbish. I thought it was neat.  6 from me. Maybe people were annoyed because the left hand edge of the "box" goes wonky.', '2006-08-17 03:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
