(2736183, 376678, 37858, '<td valign="top">This photo came from a much larger shot.  When I cropped it severely to limit the photo to this surfer I ended up with a lot of noise.  I wasn''t planning on submitting it because I knew DPC voters wouldn''t like the noise, but I reconsidered because the image looked alot like an oil or water color painting to me and I liked the effect.  Her command of the wave was impressive and the background boat added another "transportation" example.  So I got what I thought I would receive in terms of score (actually I scored a little higher than I expected) but the image appealed so I used it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This photo came from a much larger shot.  When I cropped it severely to limit the photo to this surfer I ended up with a lot of noise.  I wasn''t planning on submitting it because I knew DPC voters wouldn''t like the noise, but I reconsidered because the image looked alot like an oil or water color painting to me and I liked the effect.  Her command of the wave was impressive and the background boat added another "transportation" example.  So I got what I thought I would receive in terms of score (actually I scored a little higher than I expected) but the image appealed so I used it. ', '2006-08-17 06:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
