(2736556, 376656, 39675, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Great to see someone in Hawaii get the BLUE RIBBON!  A surf board is certainly transportation.  Anyone who had a long paddle in the morning and surfed all day will know it is transportation when they catch their last wave and ride it to shore rather than paddling.  Awesome photo!</td>', 'Congratulations!  Great to see someone in Hawaii get the BLUE RIBBON!  A surf board is certainly transportation.  Anyone who had a long paddle in the morning and surfed all day will know it is transportation when they catch their last wave and ride it to shore rather than paddling.  Awesome photo!', '2006-08-17 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2736560, 376656, 39675, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Great to see someone in Hawaii get the BLUE RIBBON!  A surf board is certainly transportation.  Anyone who had a long paddle in the morning and surfed all day will know it is transportation when they catch their last wave and ride it to shore rather than paddling.  Awesome photo!  Looks like Kewalos or Point Panic?</td>', 'Congratulations!  Great to see someone in Hawaii get the BLUE RIBBON!  A surf board is certainly transportation.  Anyone who had a long paddle in the morning and surfed all day will know it is transportation when they catch their last wave and ride it to shore rather than paddling.  Awesome photo!  Looks like Kewalos or Point Panic?', '2006-08-17 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
