(2738090, 377487, 33515, '<td valign="top">Well I see it didn''t end up being your worst scoring photo after all. :)<br/></td>', 'Well I see it didn''t end up being your worst scoring photo after all. :)', '2006-08-17 23:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2738109, 375871, 60698, '<td valign="top">The cool purple and the fiery yellow/orange creates a nice contrast. The focus is sharp so you can see many details. Bravo, for finding an interesting and beautiful photo in everyday objects. I love the colors and this photo would look nice on a wall with a frame like focuspoint said.</td>', 'The cool purple and the fiery yellow/orange creates a nice contrast. The focus is sharp so you can see many details. Bravo, for finding an interesting and beautiful photo in everyday objects. I love the colors and this photo would look nice on a wall with a frame like focuspoint said.', '2006-08-17 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
