(2739098, 376693, 51020, '<td valign="top">Since i can''t figure out how to edit my initial comments, i''d really like to say thanks to everyone who gave me a vote, and it''s my best finish by far, and i''m very happy :)<br/> <br/>initially i wanted to remove the guy and other distracting elements, but in a way i guess its lucky it was a basic editing challenge, and now i know that the dude might be something to keep for a final version.</td>', 'Since i can''t figure out how to edit my initial comments, i''d really like to say thanks to everyone who gave me a vote, and it''s my best finish by far, and i''m very happy :) initially i wanted to remove the guy and other distracting elements, but in a way i guess its lucky it was a basic editing challenge, and now i know that the dude might be something to keep for a final version.', '2006-08-18 09:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2739111, 377387, 53147, '<td valign="top">Another nice shot Deb. Good idea for the challenge - somethign a bit different without being crazy out of the box. Good detail, colors and layout. Just a very clean shot. If it had been advanced editing a little bit of burning on the car to bring out the shadow type lines would have made it pop out a bit more I think. A shame not more people had their hands in the air.</td>', 'Another nice shot Deb. Good idea for the challenge - somethign a bit different without being crazy out of the box. Good detail, colors and layout. Just a very clean shot. If it had been advanced editing a little bit of burning on the car to bring out the shadow type lines would have made it pop out a bit more I think. A shame not more people had their hands in the air.', '2006-08-18 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2739121, 376678, 53147, '<td valign="top">The severe crop does give it a painting type effect but it feels pixelated (of course). I am not sure if film grain or the grain effect is legal in basic but maybe adding a bit of that would soften the pixelated look and enhance the painting type feel. Could be a good coverup tool. I think the one votes were unnecessary.</td>', 'The severe crop does give it a painting type effect but it feels pixelated (of course). I am not sure if film grain or the grain effect is legal in basic but maybe adding a bit of that would soften the pixelated look and enhance the painting type feel. Could be a good coverup tool. I think the one votes were unnecessary.', '2006-08-18 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 0),
