(2739523, 376678, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have voted this high. I think you got robbed in terms of score, but I seem to think that voters are just outright nasty anymore. I think this is a beautiful shot and looks very much like a painting. Excellent job with the capture!</td>', 'Trading post...  I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have voted this high. I think you got robbed in terms of score, but I seem to think that voters are just outright nasty anymore. I think this is a beautiful shot and looks very much like a painting. Excellent job with the capture!', '2006-08-18 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
