(2771967, 377591, 60850, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by focuspoint:</b></div><hr/><i> How did they let you take that? hmmm... do they know?<br/> <br/>LOL<br/> <br/>6 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know I''m late responding, but I had to reply since you asked...  First of all, your comment cracked me up.  This photo went forever without a comment and yours was the first.  Thanks!<br/> <br/>And yes, they did know.  This is my brother''s car.  I had him meet me on his break just so I could take this photo.  I set the camera for a 13 sec exposure and had him hit the lights for about 1 second.  If I had to do it again, I''d set up the camera so the building wasn''t visible in the picture... I thought it was distracting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-29 23:26:21.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by focuspoint: How did they let you take that? hmmm... do they know? LOL 6   I know I''m late responding, but I had to reply since you asked...  First of all, your comment cracked me up.  This photo went forever without a comment and yours was the first.  Thanks! And yes, they did know.  This is my brother''s car.  I had him meet me on his break just so I could take this photo.  I set the camera for a 13 sec exposure and had him hit the lights for about 1 second.  If I had to do it again, I''d set up the camera so the building wasn''t visible in the picture... I thought it was distracting.', '2006-08-30 00:25:55.000000', '2006-08-30 00:26:21.000000', 0),
