(2854815, 374971, 25397, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by The Resplendent Snippycat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by focuspoint:</b></div><hr/><i> (Why do I think "Joey").... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Funny you should say that.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I miss the Zoooma''s man. :-(<br/> <br/>I miss cruisin all pimped out to the natural halfpipe, layin chicks and smokin blunts on the Zoooma. Being 12 years old didn''t matter on that badboy.</td>', 'Originally posted by The Resplendent Snippycat: Originally posted by focuspoint: (Why do I think "Joey")....  Funny you should say that....   I miss the Zoooma''s man. :-( I miss cruisin all pimped out to the natural halfpipe, layin chicks and smokin blunts on the Zoooma. Being 12 years old didn''t matter on that badboy.', '2006-09-21 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 0),
