(5518764, 377307, 66494, '<td valign="top">Your photo is the perfect example of how composition makes or breaks a photo or a painting. <br/>One of the cardinal rules is to have three items of one color that form a triangle. Check out how well that is done with the yellow house, the yellow clothing, and the yellow sign. SWWWEEEET.</td>', 'Your photo is the perfect example of how composition makes or breaks a photo or a painting. One of the cardinal rules is to have three items of one color that form a triangle. Check out how well that is done with the yellow house, the yellow clothing, and the yellow sign. SWWWEEEET.', '2009-06-07 21:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
